机或服务器上运行的模型。','General (used when nothing more specific is set)'=>'常规（未设置更具体的设置时使用）','Writing and rewriting'=>'写入与重写','Translation'=>'翻译','Code and CSS'=>'代码和 CSS','Sorry, you are not allowed to access this page.'=>'抱歉，您无权访问此页面。','These settings are shared by every plugin that uses them: %s.'=>'这些设置由使用它们的每个插件共享：%s。','Your keys are encrypted in this site\'s database and are only ever sent to the provider you chose — never to us.'=>'您的密钥已在此网站的数据库中加密，并且只会发送给您选择的服务商 — 绝不会发送给我们。','Step 1 of 2: choose an AI provider'=>'第 1 步（共 2 步）：选择 AI 提供商','You bring your own key, so you pay the provider directly for what you use. Not sure? Any of these works well; you can add more later.'=>'您使用自己的密钥，因此只需为您使用的内容直接向提供商付费。不确定如何选择？其中任何一个都运行良好；您稍后还可以添加更多。','Next'=>'下一步','Step 2 of 2: connect %s'=>'步骤 2/2：连接 %s','Enter the address of your OpenAI-compatible service, ending in /v1. A key is only needed if the service asks for one.'=>'请输入与 OpenAI 兼容的服务的地址，以 /v1 结尾。仅当该服务要求时才需要密钥。','Open %s and sign in (or create a free account).'=>'打开 %s 并登录（或创建免费账户）。','the %s API keys page'=>'%s API 密钥页面','Create a new key and copy it.'=>'创建一个新密钥并复制它。','Paste it below and press "Save and test". We send one tiny request to check it works.'=>'请将其粘贴在下方，然后点击“保存并测试”。我们将发送一个微小的请求以检查其是否正常工作。','Most providers need a little credit on the account before a key works: %s.'=>'大多数提供商都需要在账户中保留少量余额，密钥才能正常使用：%s。','add credit'=>'充值余额','← Choose a different provider'=>'← 选择其他提供商','Address'=>'地址','Saved key ends in …%s — paste a new one to replace it'=>'保存的密钥以 …%s 结尾 — 粘贴新密钥以替换它','Key (optional)'=>'密钥（可选）','API key'=>'API 密钥','Save and test'=>'保存并测试','Providers'=>'提供商','Provider'=>'服务商','Status'=>'状态','Key'=>'密钥','Get a key'=>'获取密钥','Test'=>'测试','Remove'=>'移除','Saved by a newer plugin version: update this plugin, or enter the key again.'=>'已由更新的插件版本保存：请更新此插件，或重新输入密钥。','The saved key can no longer be opened (the site\'s security keys changed). Enter it again.'=>'保存的密钥无法再打开（站点的安全密钥已更改）。请重新输入。','Not connected'=>'未连接','Connected — last test passed %s'=>'已连接 — 上次测试通过于 %s','Last test failed: %s'=>'上次测试失败：%s','Connected — not tested yet'=>'已连接 — 尚未测试','Which model to use'=>'要使用哪种模型','★ marks our recommendation for that task. The list includes every model your key can use, read live from the provider.'=>'★ 表示我们针对该任务的推荐。该列表包含您的密钥可使用的所有模型，直接从提供商实时读取。','— Recommended for the provider —'=>'— 推荐用于提供商 —','Save models'=>'保存模型','Refresh the model lists from the providers'=>'从提供商刷新模型列表','Images'=>'图像','Connect OpenAI or Google Gemini to make images.'=>'连接 OpenAI 或 Google Gemini 以生成图像。','— The newest image model of the first connected provider —'=>'— 首个已连接提供商的最新图像模型 —','Site search (embeddings)'=>'站点搜索（嵌入）','Connect Google Gemini, OpenAI, Mistral or OpenRouter to build a search index of your site.'=>'连接 Google Gemini、OpenAI、Mistral 或 OpenRouter，以构建您网站的搜索索引。','— The newest embedding model of the first connected provider —'=>'— 首个已连接提供商的最新嵌入模型 —','Changing this rebuilds the search index of every plugin that uses it.'=>'更改此项会重建每个使用它的插件的搜索索引。','best quality'=>'最佳画质','lowest cost'=>'最低成本','fastest'=>'最快','Add a model yourself'=>'自行添加模型','A model came out today? Paste its exact name to use it straight away.'=>'今天有新模型发布了吗？粘贴其确切名称即可立即使用。','Model name'=>'模型名称','Add model'=>'添加模型','Recommended models list'=>'推荐模型列表','The recommended models list could not be verified, so no recommendations are shown. Reinstall the plugin, or turn on daily updates below.'=>'无法验证推荐模型列表，因此未显示任何推荐。请重新安装插件，或在下方开启每日更新。','The list in use was published on %s. Each plugin update brings a fresh one.'=>'正在使用的列表已于 %s 发布。每次插件更新都会带来新列表。','Also check Zinn Digital® once a day for an updated list.'=>'另请每天查看一次 Zinn Digital® 以获取更新的列表。','Only a plain download request is sent: no key, no site address, nothing about your content. The list is signed, and a list that fails the signature check is ignored.'=>'仅发送普通的下载请求：没有密钥，没有站点地址，也没有关于您内容的任何信息。该列表已签名，未通过签名检查的列表将被忽略。','Last checked %1$s: %2$s.'=>'上次检查于 %1$s：%2$s。','Save, and check now if turned on'=>'保存，若已开启请立即检查','a newer list was installed'=>'已安装较新的列表','already up to date'=>'已是最新版本','the download failed the signature check and was ignored'=>'下载未通过签名检查，已被忽略','Zinn Digital® could not be reached; the current list stays in use'=>'无法访问 Zinn Digital®；继续使用当前列表','turned off'=>'已关闭','Open'=>'打开','Check their status page'=>'查看他们的状态页面','Open your billing page'=>'打开您的账单页面','Open your API keys page'=>'打开您的 API 密钥页面','Open the AI settings'=>'打开 AI 设置','Sorry, you are not allowed to do that.'=>'抱歉，您无权执行此操作。','Unknown provider.'=>'未知提供商。','Enter the address of your service, for example http://localhost:11434/v1.'=>'请输入您的服务地址，例如 http://localhost:11434/v1。','That does not look like an API key. Copy it again, without spaces.'=>'这看起来不像是 API 密钥。请重新复制，且不要包含空格。','Paste your API key first.'=>'请先粘贴您的 API 密钥。','Key removed.'=>'密钥已移除。','Models saved.'=>'模型已保存。','Enter the model\'s exact name, for example as the provider\'s documentation writes it.'=>'输入模型的确切名称，例如提供商文档中所写的名称。','Added %s. Choose it under "Which model to use".'=>'已添加 %s。请在“使用哪个模型”下进行选择。','Model removed.'=>'模型已移除。','Daily updates are off. The list that came with the plugin is used.'=>'每日更新已关闭。将使用插件附带的列表。','Checked: %s.'=>'已检查：%s。','Model lists refreshed.'=>'模型列表已刷新。','Your AI key was saved by a newer version of one of your plugins. Update this plugin, or enter the key again in the AI settings.'=>'您的 AI 密钥已由您的某个插件的较新版本保存。请更新此插件，或在 AI 设置中重新输入密钥。','Your saved AI key can no longer be opened (the site\'s security keys changed). Enter it again in the AI settings.'=>'您保存的 AI 密钥已无法打开（站点的安全密钥已更改）。请在 AI 设置中重新输入。','AI is not set up yet. Add a key for an AI provider in the AI settings.'=>'AI 尚未设置。请在 AI 设置中添加 AI 提供商的密钥。','No model is chosen for this task. Pick one in the AI settings.'=>'未为此任务选择模型。请在 AI 设置中选择一个。','That AI provider is not supported by this version of the plugin.'=>'该版本的插件不支持该 AI 提供商。','No AI provider that can make images is connected. Add an OpenAI or Google Gemini key in the AI settings.'=>'未连接能够生成图像的 AI 提供商。请在 AI 设置中添加 OpenAI 或 Google Gemini 密钥。','This AI provider cannot make images. Choose OpenAI or Google Gemini for images in the AI settings.'=>'此 AI 提供商无法生成图像。请在 AI 设置中选择 OpenAI 或 Google Gemini 处理图像。','Your AI key cannot use any image model. Check the key\'s permissions with the provider, or choose another provider for images.'=>'您的 AI 密钥无法使用任何图像模型。请与提供商核对密钥权限，或为图像选择其他提供商。','No connected AI provider can build a search index. Add a Google Gemini, OpenAI, Mistral or OpenRouter key in the AI settings.'=>'没有任何已连接的 AI 提供商可以构建搜索索引。请在 AI 设置中添加 Google Gemini、OpenAI、Mistral 或 OpenRouter 密钥。','Your AI key cannot use any embedding model. Check the key\'s permissions with the provider, or choose another provider for site search.'=>'您的 AI 密钥无法使用任何嵌入 (embedding) 模型。请与提供商核对该密钥的权限，或为网站搜索选择其他提供商。','This AI provider cannot build a search index. Connect Google Gemini, OpenAI, Mistral or a compatible service for site search.'=>'此 AI 提供商无法构建搜索索引。请连接 Google Gemini、OpenAI、Mistral 或兼容的服务以进行站点搜索。','This site could not reach your AI service. Check that it is running and that its address is reachable from your web server (a service on your own computer is not reachable from a hosted site).'=>'此站点无法连接到您的 AI 服务。请检查它是否正在运行，以及您的 Web 服务器是否可以访问其地址（托管站点无法访问您自己计算机上的服务）。','This site could not reach %s. Check their status page; if they are up, your host may be blocking outgoing connections, or the address is wrong.'=>'本站点无法连接至 %s。请检查其状态页面；如果其正常运行，则可能是您的主机阻止了对外连接，或者地址有误。','%s says your account has no credit or quota left. Add credit or raise your limit in your account with them, then try again.'=>'%s 显示您的账户已无剩余额度或配额。请在对方平台的账户中充值额度或提高限额，然后重试。','%s did not accept your key. It may be mistyped, revoked or expired. Create a new key and paste it here.'=>'%s 未接受您的密钥。它可能输入有误、已被撤销或已过期。请创建一个新密钥并粘贴到此处。','%s refused this request for your key. The key may not have access to this model or feature, or your account needs verifying.'=>'%s 拒绝了您的密钥的此请求。该密钥可能无法访问此模型或功能，或者您的账户需要验证。','The model "%1$s" is not available from %2$s for your key. Choose another model in the AI settings.'=>'模型“%1$s”无法通过 %2$s 用于您的密钥。请在 AI 设置中选择其他模型。','Your %2$s plan does not include the model "%1$s". Choose another model in the AI settings, or upgrade your plan with them.'=>'您的 %2$s 方案不包含模型“%1$s”。请在 AI 设置中选择其他模型，或向他们升级您的方案。','%s is limiting how fast your key can send requests. Wait a minute and try again, or raise your rate limit with them.'=>'%s 正在限制您的密钥发送请求的频率。请稍等一分钟后再试，或者向其申请提高您的速率限制。','%s is having problems right now (an outage or overload on their side). Nothing is wrong with your settings. Try again shortly.'=>'%s目前遇到了问题（其服务器发生故障或过载）。您的设置没有问题。请稍后重试。','The AI request failed for a reason we could not identify. Try again; if it keeps happening, contact support with the details below.'=>'AI 请求失败，原因无法确定。请重试；如果问题仍然出现，请携带以下详细信息联系支持团队。','The AI provider answered in a form this plugin could not read. Try again; if it keeps happening, choose another model or contact support.'=>'AI 提供商返回的格式导致此插件无法读取。请重试；如果问题仍然出现，请选择其他模型或联系支持团队。','Custom (OpenAI-compatible)'=>'自定义（兼容 OpenAI）','Save a key for this provider first.'=>'请先为此提供商保存密钥。','Your key works, but the provider lists no text model for it. Add a model yourself below.'=>'您的密钥有效，但提供商未列出适用于它的文本模型。请在下方自行添加模型。','Connected. %1$s answered using %2$s. Your AI features are ready to use.'=>'已连接。%1$s 已使用 %2$s 作出回复。您的人工智能功能已准备就绪，可以使用。','Your user role is not allowed to use AI on this site. Ask an administrator.'=>'您的用户角色不被允许在此站点上使用 AI。请咨询管理员。','This site has reached its monthly AI spending limit. An administrator can raise it in the AI settings.'=>'此站点已达到其每月 AI 支出限额。管理员可以在 AI 设置中调高该限额。','This site has reached its monthly limit of AI requests. An administrator can raise it in the AI settings.'=>'此站点已达到其每月 AI 请求上限。管理员可以在 AI 设置中提高该上限。','Usage and cost'=>'用量与费用','The log, limits and role permissions apply to AI used through: %s.'=>'日志、限制和角色权限适用于通过以下方式使用的 AI：%s。','Costs are approximate, worked out from published prices; a model with no known price counts as zero.'=>'费用为估算值，根据公布的价格计算得出；没有已知价格的型号计为零。','This month: %1$s requests, about %2$s.'=>'本月：%1$s 次请求，约 %2$s。','When'=>'时间','Who'=>'操作者','Used for'=>'用于','Model'=>'型号','Tokens in / out'=>'输入 / 输出 Token','About'=>'关于','Result'=>'结果','No AI requests have been made yet.'=>'尚未提出任何 AI 请求。','Done'=>'完成','Limits and permissions'=>'限制与权限','Monthly spending limit (US dollars)'=>'每月支出限额（US 美元）','Leave empty for no limit. AI stops for the rest of the month once the approximate cost reaches it.'=>'留空表示不设限制。一旦大概费用达到此上限，AI 将在该月剩余时间内停止运行。','Monthly request limit'=>'每月请求限制','Leave empty for no limit.'=>'留空表示无限制。','Who may use AI'=>'谁可以使用 AI','Tick none to let everyone who can use the plugin\'s features use AI. Administrators can always use it.'=>'不要勾选任何选项，以允许所有可以使用插件功能的用户使用 AI。管理员始终可以使用它。','Save limits and permissions'=>'保存限制和权限','Limits and permissions saved.'=>'限制和权限已保存。','The post or page ID.'=>'文章或页面 ID。','Write or rewrite text with AI'=>'使用 AI 编写或重写文本','Writes new text, or improves, shortens, expands, changes the tone of or fixes the grammar of a piece of text, with the site\'s own AI provider. Returns the new text; nothing on the site is changed.'=>'通过站点自有的 AI 提供商撰写新文本，或者对一段文本进行润色、缩短、扩写、更改语气或修复语法错误。返回新文本；站点上的任何内容均不会被更改。','Generate a section with AI'=>'使用 AI 生成区块','Turns a one-sentence description into a ready-designed section (real, editable blocks in the site\'s brand style) with text written for it. Returns the block markup, and adds it to the start or end of a page when a post_id is given (a revision keeps what was there before).'=>'将一句描述转化为包含专用文案、设计完毕的分块（采用网站品牌风格的真实、可编辑区块）。返回区块标记代码，并在提供 post_id 时将其添加到页面的开头或结尾（修订版本会保留之前的内容）。','Suggest an SEO title and description with AI'=>'使用 AI 建议 SEO 标题和描述','Reads a page and suggests a meta title (up to 60 characters) and meta description (up to 155), optionally around a focus keyword. Nothing is saved.'=>'读取页面并提供元标题（最多 60 个字符）和元描述（最多 155 个字符）建议，可选择围绕焦点关键词生成。不会保存任何内容。','Save an SEO title and description'=>'保存 SEO 标题和描述','Saves a meta title and description into the SEO plugin the site uses (Yoast SEO, Rank Math, SEOPress or All in One SEO) and says which ones were written.'=>'将 Meta 标题和描述保存到网站使用的 SEO 插件（Yoast SEO、Rank Math、SEOPress 或 All in One SEO）中，并说明写入了哪些内容。','Write image alt text with AI'=>'使用 AI 编写图像替代文本','Looks at images and saves alt text for them: one image (attachment_id), or every image on a page that has none (post_id). At most 20 images per call; the answer says how many remain.'=>'查看图像并为其保存替代文本：单个图像 (attachment_id)，或页面上每个缺少替代文本的图像 (post_id)。每次调用最多处理 20 张图像；响应中会注明剩余数量。','Undo an AI change'=>'撤销 AI 更改','Puts a page back the way it was before an AI change, from the undo_revision that change returned.'=>'根据 AI 更改返回的 undo_revision，将页面恢复到更改前的状态。','AI is not available in this build.'=>'此版本不支持 AI 功能。','The AI answered in a form the builder cannot read. Try again, or choose another model in the AI settings.'=>'AI 回复的格式无法被构建器读取。请重试，或在 AI 设置中选择其他模型。','The AI request failed. Try again.'=>'AI 请求失败。请重试。','The AI rewrote %1$d of %2$d pieces of text, so nothing was changed. Try again.'=>'人工智能重写了 %2$d 处文本中的 %1$d 处，因此未做任何更改。请重试。','The AI used blocks this site does not have (%s), so nothing was changed. Try again.'=>'AI 使用了此站点没有的区块 (%s)，因此未做任何更改。请重试。','The AI answer contained markup your account may not save, so nothing was changed.'=>'AI 回答中包含您的账户可能无法保存的标记，因此未做任何更改。','There is no such post, or you may not edit it.'=>'不存在该文章，或者您可能没有权限编辑它。','That change can no longer be undone: its saved copy is gone.'=>'该更改已无法撤销：其保存的副本已丢失。','The change could not be undone. Restore it from the post\'s revisions instead.'=>'无法撤销更改。请改为从文章修订版本中恢复。','The page has too little text to write a description from. Add content first.'=>'该页面的文本过少，无法撰写描述。请先添加内容。','No supported SEO plugin is active (Yoast SEO, Rank Math, SEOPress or All in One SEO), so there is nowhere to save the meta title and description.'=>'未激活任何受支持的 SEO 插件（Yoast SEO、Rank Math、SEOPress 或 All in One SEO），因此无法保存 Meta 标题和描述。','That is not an image you may edit.'=>'那不是您可以编辑的图像。','Only PNG, JPEG, GIF and WebP images can be described.'=>'仅可描述 PNG、JPEG、GIF 和 WebP 图像。','The image is too large to send to the AI (4 MB at most).'=>'图像太大，无法发送给 AI（最多 4 MB）。','Unknown AI writing action.'=>'未知的 AI 写作操作。','There is no text to rewrite. Type some first, or ask AI to write it.'=>'没有可重写的文本。请先输入一些内容，或让 AI 来编写。','Say what the text should be about.'=>'请说明文本的主题。','Choose one of the offered tones.'=>'请选择所提供的其中一种语调。','That is too much text for one AI request. Select a shorter part.'=>'单次 AI 请求的文本过多。请选择较短的部分。','The AI returned no text. Try again.'=>'AI 未返回任何文本。请重试。','Describe the section in a sentence (up to 2,000 characters).'=>'请用一句话描述该部分（最多 2,000 个字符）。','There are no sections in the library to build from.'=>'库中没有可用于构建的章节。','There is no section called "%s".'=>'没有名为“%s”的小节。','The AI did not choose a section from the library. Pick one yourself, or describe it differently.'=>'AI 未从资料库中选择区块。请您自行选择一个，或换种方式对其进行描述。','Security error, please refresh the page and try again.'=>'安全错误，请刷新页面并重试。','Missing newsletter settings. Please contact the admin.'=>'缺少简报设置。请联系管理员。','Invalid newsletter settings. Please contact the admin.'=>'简报设置无效。请与管理员联系。','Invalid email address.'=>'无效的电子邮件地址。','Please tick the box to agree before subscribing.'=>'订阅前请勾选方框以表示同意。','Too many attempts. Please try again in a few minutes.'=>'尝试次数过多。请在几分钟后重试。','Something went wrong. Please contact the admin.'=>'出错了。请联系管理员。','Map'=>'地图','Background video'=>'背景视频','%1$s: %2$d font files stored, stylesheet %3$s'=>'%1$s：%2$d 个字体文件已存储，样式表 %3$s','That family is not stored.'=>'该字体族未存储。','Removed.'=>'已移除。','That is not a valid font family name.'=>'这不是有效的字体系列名称。','Google Fonts did not return that family. Check the name and try again.'=>'Google Fonts 未返回该字体系列。请检查名称并重试。','The font files could not be downloaded or saved. Check that the uploads folder is writable.'=>'无法下载或保存字体文件。请检查上传文件夹是否可写。','The font stylesheet could not be saved. Check that the uploads folder is writable.'=>'无法保存字体样式表。请检查上传文件夹是否可写。','Dismiss this notice'=>'忽略此通知','(opens in a new tab)'=>'(在