l sauces.'=>'每天早晨手工制作，搭配当季酱汁供应。','Desserts'=>'甜点','Tarts, ices and a cheese board from local makers.'=>'来自本地生产者的果馅饼、冰品和芝士拼盘。','Set lunch'=>'设置午餐','Two or three courses at a fixed price, Tuesday to Friday.'=>'周二至周五，两道或三道菜品套餐享固定优惠价。','Private dining'=>'包间用餐','A private room for up to 18 guests with a tailored menu.'=>'可容纳多达18位宾客的独立包厢，配有量身定制的菜单。','SaaS Product'=>'SaaS 产品','Is there a free plan?'=>'是否有免费方案？','Yes, free for small teams, and every paid plan starts with a 14-day trial.'=>'是的，小团队免费，且每个付费方案都包含 14 天免费试用。','Can I cancel any time?'=>'我可以随时取消吗？','Yes. Monthly plans can be cancelled at any time.'=>'是的。月度方案可随时取消。','Where is my data stored?'=>'我的数据存储在哪里？','In secure, encrypted data centres, with daily backups.'=>'在安全、加密的数据中心内，提供每日备份。','Everything your team needs'=>'您团队所需的一切','Boards and timelines'=>'看板和时间线','Switch between kanban boards and timelines in one click.'=>'只需点击一下即可在看板和时间线之间切换。','Automations'=>'自动化','Move tasks, assign owners and send reminders automatically.'=>'移动任务、指派负责人并自动发送提醒。','Shared files'=>'共享文件','Keep documents next to the work they belong to.'=>'将文档保存在其所属的工作旁边。','Reports'=>'报告','Live dashboards for workload, progress and deadlines.'=>'用于显示工作量、进度和截止日期的实时仪表盘。','Integrations'=>'集成','Connect the email, chat and storage tools you already use.'=>'连接您已在使用的电子邮件、聊天和存储工具。','Security'=>'安全性','Single sign-on, audit logs and encrypted data.'=>'单点登录、审计日志和加密数据。','14-day free trial, no card needed'=>'14 天免费试用，无需信用卡','Plan projects, not spreadsheets'=>'规划项目，而非电子表格','One workspace for tasks, deadlines and files. Your team sees what matters today, and you see progress without asking for updates.'=>'集任务、截止日期和文件于一体的工作区。您的团队能了解当下的重点，您也可以无需询问进度便直接掌握动态。','Start free trial'=>'开始免费试用','See features'=>'查看功能','Up and running in minutes'=>'数分钟即可启动并运行','Create a workspace'=>'创建工作区','Sign up and invite your team in minutes.'=>'立即注册并在几分钟内邀请您的团队。','Import your work'=>'导入您的作品','Bring tasks in from a spreadsheet or another tool.'=>'从电子表格或其他工具导入任务。','Get moving'=>'立即行动','Templates