 分钟后仍未收到，请检查您的垃圾邮件箱。','Verified'=>'已验证','Verify Email'=>'验证电子邮件','product versionVersion'=>'版本','Version %s was released.'=>'版本 %s 已发布。','View details'=>'查看详细信息','Click to view full-size screenshot %d'=>'点击查看完整尺寸的屏幕截图 %d','View paid features'=>'查看付费功能','Warning'=>'警告','What is your %s?'=>'您的%s是什么？','Used to express elation, enthusiasm, or triumph (especially in electronic communication).W00t'=>'太棒了','WordPress.org Plugin Page'=>'WordPress.org 插件页面','It seems like one of the authentication parameters is wrong. Update your Public Key, Secret Key & User ID, and try again.'=>'其中一个身份验证参数似乎有误。请更新您的 Public Key、Secret Key 与 User ID，然后重试。','%s ago'=>'%s前','as 5 licenses left%s left'=>'剩余 %s','%s or higher'=>'%s 或更高版本','%s\'s paid features'=>'%s 的付费功能','e.g. Professional Plan%s Plan'=>'%s计划','%s rating'=>'%s 评分','%s ratings'=>'%s 个评分','%s sec'=>'%s 秒','%s star'=>'%s 星','%s stars'=>'%s 颗星','%s time'=>'%s时间','%s times'=>'%s 次','You have successfully updated your %s.'=>'您已成功更新您的%s。','as annual periodyear'=>'年','interjection expressing joy or exuberanceYee-haw'=>'呀嗬','Yes'=>'是','You are all good!'=>'一切就绪！','You are just one step away - %s'=>'您距离完成仅一步之遥 - %s','Seems like you got the latest release.'=>'看来您拥有最新版本。','You should receive %3$s for %1$s to your mailbox at %2$s in the next 5 minutes.'=>'您应该会在接下来的 5 分钟内在 %2$s 上的邮箱中收到针对 %1$s 的 %3$s。','ZIP / Postal Code'=>'邮政编码',' %1$s to access version %2$s security & feature updates, and support.'=>' %1$s以获取版本 %2$s 的安全性与功能更新以及支持。','%1$s automatic security & feature updates and paid functionality will keep working without interruptions until %2$s (or when your license expires, whatever comes first).'=>'%1$s 自动安全与功能更新以及付费功能将持续不间断运行，直至 %2$s（或在您的许可证到期时，以先到者为准）。','%1$s to access version %2$s security & feature updates, and support.'=>'%1$s以获取版本 %2$s 的安全性与功能更新以及支持。','API'=>'API','An unknown error has occurred while trying to set the user\'s beta mode.'=>'尝试设置用户的测试模式时发生了未知错误。','An unknown error has occurred while trying to toggle the license\'s white-label mode.'=>'尝试切换许可证的白标模式时发生未知错误。','Annual'=>'按年','By clicking "Opt Out", %s will no longer be able to view your name and email.'=>'点击“退出”，%s 将无法再查看您的姓名和电子邮件。','By clicking "Opt Out", diagnostic data will no longer be sent to %s.'=>'点击“停用”，诊断数据将不再发送到 %s。','By disconnecting the website, previously shared diagnostic data about %1$s will be deleted and no longer visible to %2$s.'=>'断开与网站的连接后，先前共享的关于 %1$s 的诊断数据将被删除，且对 %2$s 不再可见。','By opting out from sharing this information with the updates server, you’ll have to check for new %1$s releases and manually download & install them. Not just a hassle, but missing an update can put your site at risk and cause undue compatibility issues, so we highly recommend keeping these essential permissions on.'=>'若选择不与更新服务器共享这些信息，您将必须自行检查新的 %1$s 版本，并手动下载与安装。这不仅非常繁琐，而且遗漏更新还可能使您的站点面临风险并导致不必要的兼容性问题，因此我们强烈建议您保持开启这些必要权限。','Cancel %1$s - I no longer need any security & feature updates, nor support for %2$s because I\'m not planning to use the %3$s on this, or any other site.'=>'取消 %1$s - 我不再需要任何安全与功能更新，也不再需要对 %2$s 的支持，因为我不打算在此站点或任何其他站点上使用该 %3$s。','Cancel %s?'=>'取消 %s 吗？','Cancelling %s'=>'正在取消 %s','Cancelling %s...'=>'正在取消 %s...','Click here'=>'点击此处','Deactivating'=>'正在停用','Disconnecting the website will permanently remove %s from your User Dashboard\'s account.'=>'断开网站连接将从您的用户仪表盘账户中永久移除 %s。','For automatic delivery of security & feature updates, and license management & protection, %s needs to:'=>'为了自动获取安全性与功能更新，以及进行许可证管理和保护，%s 需要：','For delivery of security & feature updates, and license management, %s needs to'=>'为了交付安全性与功能更新以及进行许可证管理，%s 需要','Freemius is our licensing and software updates engine'=>'Freemius 是我们的许可和软件更新引擎','If this is a long term duplicate, to keep automatic updates and paid functionality after %1$s, please %2$s.'=>'如果这是一个长期存在的副本，为了在 %1$s 之后继续保留自动更新和付费功能，请%2$s。','Is %2$s a duplicate of %4$s?'=>'%2$s 是 %4$s 的副本吗？','Join the Beta Program'=>'加入 Beta 计划','Join the Beta program'=>'加入 Beta 计划','License'=>'许可证','License Key'=>'许可证密钥','License key'=>'许可证密钥','Monthly'=>'按月','Names, slugs, versions, and if active or not'=>'名称、别名、版本以及是否处于启用状态','New Version Available'=>'有新版本可用','Optional'=>'选填','Plan'=>'套餐','Products'=>'产品','Sharing diagnostic data helps to provide additional functionality that\'s relevant to your website, avoid WordPress or PHP version incompatibilities that can break the website, and recognize which languages & regions the %s should be translated and tailored to.'=>'共享诊断数据有助于提供与您的网站相关的附加功能，避免可能导致网站崩溃的 WordPress 或 PHP 版本不兼容问题，并识别 %s 应翻译和定制为哪些语言和地区。','So you can reuse the license when the %s is no longer active.'=>'以便您可以在 %s 不再处于活动状态时重新使用该许可证。','Subscription'=>'订阅','The %1$s will be periodically sending essential license data to %2$s to check for security and feature updates, and verify the validity of your license.'=>'%1$s 将定期向 %2$s 发送必要的许可证数据，以检查安全性与功能更新，并验证您的许可证有效性。','There is a %1$s of %2$s available.'=>'有 %2$s 的 %1$s 可用。','To ensure compatibility and avoid conflicts with your installed plugins and themes.'=>'为了确保兼容性并避免与您已安装的插件和主题发生冲突。','Trial'=>'试用','View %s State'=>'查看 %s 状态','View Basic %s Info'=>'查看基本%s信息','Yes, %2$s is a duplicate of %4$s for the purpose of testing, staging, or development.'=>'是的，%2$s 是 %4$s 的副本，用于测试、预发布或开发目的。','You have a %s license.'=>'您拥有 %s 许可证。','You have purchased a %s license.'=>'您已购买 %s 许可证。','You should receive a confirmation email for %1$s to your mailbox at %2$s. Please make sure you click the button in that email to %3$s.'=>'您应该会在 %2$s 的邮箱中收到一封关于 %1$s 的确认电子邮件。请确保点击该邮件中的按钮以%3$s。','days'=>'天','deactivating'=>'正在停用','hour'=>'小时','hours'=>'小时','license'=>'许可证','optional'=>'可选','products'=>'产品','skip'=>'跳过','subscription'=>'订阅','trial'=>'试用','Clone resolution admin notice products list labelProducts'=>'产品','as activating pluginActivating'=>'正在激活','as software licenseLicense'=>'许可证','close a windowDismiss'=>'忽略','close windowDismiss'=>'忽略','like websitesSites'=>'站点','nounPricing'=>'价格','trial periodTrial'=>'试用','verbOpt In'=>'选择加入','verbOpt Out'=>'选择退出','verbSkip'=>'跳过','verbUpgrade'=>'升级','x-ago%s ago'=>'%s前','The action could not be completed. Try again, and if it keeps failing, contact the site administrator.'=>'该操作无法完成。请重试，如果仍然失败，请联系站点管理员。','Connect an AI app'=>'连接 AI 应用','This connection request has expired. Go back to the app and start connecting again.'=>'此连接请求已过期。请返回该应用程序并重新开始连接。','%1$s is asking to use %2$s on this site as %3$s. It can do only what your WordPress account is allowed to do, and you can disconnect it at any time from the AI agents (MCP) settings.'=>'%1$s 正请求在此站点上以 %3$s 的身份使用 %2$s。它只能执行您的 WordPress 账户有权执行的操作，并且您可以随时从 AI agents (MCP) 设置中将其断开连接。','%1$s identified itself from %2$s.'=>'%1$s 已从 %2$s 表明其身份。','%1$s registered itself automatically. Only continue if you started this from %2$s.'=>'%1$s已自动注册。仅当您是从%2$s发起此操作时才继续。','Your account cannot use these tools on this site. Ask an administrator.'=>'您的账户无法在此站点上使用这些工具。请联系管理员。','After you answer you will go back to %s.'=>'回答后，您将返回 %s。','Allow %s'=>'允许 %s','Do not allow'=>'不允许','A required value is missing or has the wrong form. Check the ability\'s input schema.'=>'缺少必填值或格式不正确。请检查该能力的输入架构（input schema）。','The site refused the request.'=>'该站点拒绝了请求。','Unknown tool.'=>'未知工具。','AI agents (MCP)'=>'AI 代理 (MCP)','Let AI assistants such as Claude, Cursor or VS Code work on this site for you through MCP (Model Context Protocol). They sign in as a WordPress user (Claude and ChatGPT by approving them here, others with an application password) and can do only what that user is allowed to do.'=>'让 Claude、Cursor 或 VS Code 等 AI 助手通过 MCP（模型上下文协议）为您操作此站点。它们以 WordPress 用户的身份登录（Claude 和 ChatGPT 通过在此处获得您的批准登录，其他工具则使用应用程序密码登录），并且只能执行该用户获准执行的操作。','AI agents need WordPress 6.9 or later. Update WordPress to use them.'=>'AI 代理需要 WordPress 6.9 或更高版本。请更新 WordPress 以使用它们。','Allow AI agents (MCP)'=>'允许 AI 代理 (MCP)','Off: the tools below and their REST routes are not registered at all.'=>'关闭：以下工具及其 REST 路由完全未注册。','Connection address (MCP endpoint)'=>'连接地址 (MCP 端点)','Claude and ChatGPT: sign in instead'=>'Claude 和 ChatGPT：改为登录','Add the connection address as a custom connector in Claude, or as an app in ChatGPT developer mode. They open this site so you can approve them; no password to copy.'=>'将连接地址在 Claude 中添加为自定义连接器，或在 ChatGPT 开发者模式中添加为应用。它们会打开此站点以便您进行批准；无需复制密码。','AI apps connected to your account:'=>'已连接到您账户的 AI 应用程序：','Other AI apps: an application password'=>'其他 AI 应用程序：应用程序密码','Create an application password for your user'=>'为您的用户创建一个应用程序密码','Add this to your AI app’s MCP settings, with your username and that password:'=>'将此内容连同您的用户名和该密码一起添加到您的 AI 应用程序的 MCP 设置中：','VS Code: put the same entry under "servers" in .vscode/mcp.json, not under "mcpServers".'=>'VS Code：将相同的条目放在 .vscode/mcp.json 中的 "servers" 下，而不是 "mcpServers" 下。','Tools an AI agent can use here (%d):'=>'AI 代理在此处可以使用的工具 (%d)：','User guide: AI agents and MCP'=>'用户指南：AI 智能体与 MCP','Developer docs: abilities, REST and MCP'=>'开发者文档：能力、REST 和 MCP','Build and edit this site\'s pages from Page Builder Sandwich sections and website kits.'=>'从 Page Builder Sandwich 区块和网站套件构建并编辑此站点的页面。','Pages, sections and website kits.'=>'页面、区块和网站套件。','List pages'=>'列出页面','Lists the pages you can edit, newest first, with an optional search.'=>'列出您可以编辑的页面，最新的排在最前，并带有可选的搜索功能。','Words to search for in the title and content.'=>'在标题和内容中要搜索的词。','Read a page'=>'阅读页面','Returns a page\'s title, status, links and block content, and the sections (top-level blocks) it is made of.'=>'返回页面的标题、状态、链接和区块内容，以及组成该页面的各个部分（顶层区块）。','Create a page'=>'创建页面','Creates a page from library sections and/or block content. A new page is a draft unless another status is asked for.'=>'从库部分和/或区块内容创建页面。除非请求其他状态，否则新页面为草稿。','Update a page'=>'更新页面','Changes a page\'s title, status or block content. Content you send replaces the page\'s content.'=>'更改页面的标题、状态或区块内容。您发送的内容将替换该页面的内容。','List sections'=>'列出部分','Lists the ready-made sections (hero, features, FAQ, testimonials, call to action and more) that can be added to a page.'=>'列出可添加到页面的现成区块（首屏横幅、功能特性、常见问题、用户评价、行动号召等）。','Words to match in a section\'s name or keywords.'=>'要在分段名称或关键词中匹配的字词。','Add a section to a page'=>'向页面添加分区','Adds a ready-made section to a page: at the start, at the end, or after the section at a given position.'=>'向页面添加现成板块：在开头、在末尾，或在指定位置的板块之后。','The name of a section in this site\'s section library.'=>'此站点区块库中某个区块的名称。','With position "after": the 0-based position of the section to insert after.'=>'位置为“after”：要插入其后的分块的以 0 为基准的位置。','List website kits'=>'列出网站套件','Lists the website kits (a set of ready-made pages for one kind of business) this site can import.'=>'列出此站点可以导入的网站套件（针对特定业务类型的一组现成页面）。','Import a website kit'=>'导入网站套件','Imports a website kit\'s pages (all of them, or the ones named), optionally publishing them, setting the home page and adding them to a menu. Importing again updates the same pages.'=>'导入网站套件的页面（全部或指定页面），可选择发布它们、设置主页并将它们添加到菜单中。再次导入会更新相同的页面。','List the builder blocks'=>'列出构建器区块','Lists every Page Builder Sandwich block this site can use (Pro blocks too when Pro is active): name, title, category and description.'=>'列出此站点可以使用的每个 Page Builder Sandwich 区块（Pro 处于激活状态时也包括 Pro 区块）：名称、标题、分类和描述。','Describe a builder block'=>'描述构建器区块','Returns one block\'s settings (attributes with their types, choices and defaults), what it supports, which blocks it may contain, and a ready-to-use example in block markup.'=>'返回单个块的设置（属性及其类型、选项和默认值）、它所支持的功能、它可能包含的块，以及块标记中现成可用的示例。','Where the block is: its position among the page\'s sections, then among that block\'s inner blocks, and so on (0-based), in the order the page lists them.'=>'区块所在的位置：它在页面各部分中的位置，然后是在该区块内部区块中的位置，依此类推（从 0 开始），按照页面列出它们的顺序。','Change one block\'s settings'=>'更改单个区块的设置','Changes the settings (attributes) of one block inside a page, found by its path; attributes you send are merged over the current ones. Works on blocks the site renders from their settings; a block whose HTML is saved in the page is changed by replacing the page\'s markup.'=>'通过路径查找并更改页面内某个区块的设置（属性）；您发送的属性将与当前属性合并。适用于网站根据其设置渲染的区块；HTML 保存在页面中的区块则通过替换页面标记来进行更改。','Remove a block from a page'=>'从页面中移除区块','Removes one block (a whole section, or a block inside one) from a page, found by its path. The page\'s previous version stays in its revisions.'=>'根据路径移除页面中的一个区块（整个区块部分或其中的一个区块）。该页面的上一版本会保留在其修订历史中。','Move a section'=>'移动分区','Moves a section of a page from one position to another (0-based, in the order the page lists them).'=>'将页面的某个部分从一个位置移动到另一个位置（从 0 开始，按页面列出它们的顺序）。','Duplicate a page'=>'复制页面','Copies a page (its title, content and template) into a new draft.'=>'将页面（其标题、内容和模板）复制到新草稿中。','Move a page to the trash'=>'将页面移至回收站','Moves a page to the trash. It can be restored from Pages, Trash for 30 days.'=>'将页面移至回收站。可在 30 天内从“页面”、“回收站”中恢复。','Build a landing page'=>'构建着陆页','A guided workflow: the agent picks sections that fit your business, builds the page as a draft and writes its text.'=>'引导式工作流程：代理会选择适合您业务的部分，将页面构建为草稿并编写其文本。','The business, its offer and its audience.'=>'企业、其产品与目标受众。','A page can be a draft, pending review, published or private.'=>'页面可以是草稿、等待复审、已发布或私密。','Give the page a title.'=>'为页面指定一个标题。','%s saves its HTML in the page, so its settings cannot be changed on their own. Send the page\'s new markup with pbs/update-page.'=>'%s 将其 HTML 保存在页面中，因此其设置无法单独更改。请使用 pbs/update-page 发送页面的新标记。','%s (copy)'=>'%s（副本）','The page could not be moved to the trash.'=>'页面无法移至回收站。','Build a landing page on this WordPress site for: %s. Steps: 1) call pbs-list-sections and choose 4 to 6 sections in a sensible order (hero first, a call to action last); 2) call pbs-create-page with a title and those sections, as a draft; 3) call pbs-get-page and rewrite every piece of placeholder text for this business with pbs-update-page (keep every block comment and tag as it is); 4) if pbs-generate-page is available, you may use it instead of steps 1 to 3; 5) report the page\'s edit link and do not publish it without asking.'=>'在此 WordPress 网站上为：%s 构建一个着陆页。步骤：1) 调用 pbs-list-sections 并按合理的顺序选择 4 到 6 个区块（首推首屏区，最后为行动呼吁区）；2) 调用 pbs-create-page，附带标题及这些区块，保存为草稿；3) 调用 pbs-get-page 并使用 pbs-update-page 为该业务重写每处占位符文本（保留所有区块注释与标签的原样）；4) 若 pbs-generate-page 可用，您可以使用它来代替步骤 1 至 3；5) 报告该页面的编辑链接，未经询问请勿发布。','There is no block at that position. Read the page with pbs/get-page first.'=>'该位置没有区块。请先使用 pbs/get-page 读取页面。','There is no block called "%s". See pbs/list-blocks.'=>'不存在名为“%s”的区块。请参阅 pbs/list-blocks。','The page has no section at that position.'=>'该页面在该位置没有区块。','That is not a kit name. See pbs/list-kits.'=>'这不是套件名称。请查看 pbs/list-kits。','There is no section called "%s". See pbs/list-sections.'=>'不存在名为“%s”的小节。请参阅 pbs/list-sections。','Names of sections in this site\'s section library, in page order. They come before any content given.'=>'此站点区块库中的区块名称，按页面顺序排列。它们位于任何所提供的内容之前。','Block markup (the format the block editor saves).'=>'区块标记（区块编辑器保存的格式）。','There is no page with that ID.'=>'不存在该 ID 的页面。','You are not allowed to do that to this page.'=>'您无权对该页面执行此操作。','Connect Adobe Fonts (Pro)'=>'连接 Adobe Fonts (Pro)','Connects an Adobe Fonts (Typekit) web project by its kit id, so its fonts appear in the font pickers.'=>'通过其 kit id 连接 Adobe Fonts (Typekit) Web 项目，以便其字体显示在字体选择器中。','Change the brand kit (Pro)'=>'更改品牌套件 (Pro)','Saves the brand kit: name, logo, colours, heading and body fonts, and the brand voice AI writing uses.'=>'保存品牌套件：名称、徽标、颜色、标题和正文字体，以及 AI 写作所使用的品牌基调。','Apply the brand kit (Pro)'=>'应用品牌套件 (Pro)','Applies the saved brand kit\'s colours and fonts to the site design.'=>'将保存的品牌套件颜色和字体应用到网站设计。','Read the responsive breakpoints'=>'读取自适应断点','Returns the tablet and mobile widths (and custom breakpoints in Pro) the responsive controls use.'=>'返回自适应控件所使用的平板电脑和移动设备宽度（以及 Pro 版中的自定义断点）。','Change the responsive breakpoints'=>'更改响应式断点','Changes the tablet and mobile widths in pixels; with Pro, custom extra breakpoints.'=>'以像素为单位更改平板电脑和移动设备的宽度；使用 Pro 可自定义额外的断点。','Create a global class (Pro)'=>'创建全局类 (Pro)','Creates a reusable global style class: label, slug and its styles (s).'=>'创建一个可重复使用的全局样式类：标签、别名及其样式。','Delete a global class (Pro)'=>'删除全局类 (Pro)','Deletes a global class. Elements that used it keep their content and lose its styles.'=>'删除全局类。使用该类的元素将保留其内容并失去其样式。','Change a global class (Pro)'=>'更改全局类 (Pro)','Changes a global class\'s label, slug or styles; every element using it updates.'=>'更改全局类的标签、别名或样式；使用它的每个元素都将更新。','Duplicate a global class (Pro)'=>'复制全局类 (Pro)','Copies a global class under a new id.'=>'在新的 ID 下复制全局类。','Turn on an uploaded font (Pro)'=>'启用已上传的字体 (Pro)','Makes an uploaded custom font (a font file in the media library, by id) available in the font pickers.'=>'使上传的自定义字体（媒体库中的字体文件，按 ID）在字体选择器中可用。','Turn off an uploaded font (Pro)'=>'关闭已上传的字体 (Pro)','Removes a custom font (by slug) from the font pickers.'=>'从字体选择器中移除自定义字体（按别名）。','Change dark mode (Pro)'=>'更改深色模式 (Pro)','Sets dark mode (mode: off, auto or toggle) and its colours.'=>'设置暗色模式（模式：关闭、自动或切换）及其颜色。','Read the site design'=>'阅读站点设计','Returns the site-wide colours and fonts (heading and body) every block uses, as the Site design screen shows them.'=>'返回每个区块使用的全站颜色和字体（标题和正文），如“站点设计”屏幕所示。','Change the site design'=>'更改站点设计','Changes the site-wide colours (colors), fonts (fonts, headingFont, bodyFont). Every page picks the change up; the theme\'s theme.json is kept in sync.'=>'更改全站的颜色（colors）、字体（fonts、headingFont、bodyFont）。每个页面都会应用此更改；主题的 theme.json 将保持同步。','Read the design system (Pro)'=>'阅读设计系统 (Pro)','Returns the Pro design system: global classes, variables, design tokens, dark mode, brand kit and custom fonts.'=>'返回 Pro 设计系统：全局类、变量、设计令牌、深色模式、品牌工具包和自定义字体。','Change the design tokens (Pro)'=>'更改设计令牌（专业版）','Changes the spacing, radius and shadow scales (space, radius, shadow), or resets them (reset).'=>'更改间距、圆角和阴影比例（space, radius, shadow），或将其重置（reset）。','Change the CSS variables (Pro)'=>'更改 CSS 变量 (Pro)','Replaces the site\'s design variables (variables: a list of name and value).'=>'替换站点的设计变量（变量：名称和值的列表）。','List the dynamic content sources (Pro)'=>'列出动态内容源 (Pro)','Returns what a block can be filled from (post, author, site, archive, custom field, product) with each source\'s fields, the field plugins on this site (ACF, Meta Box, Pods, JetEngine, Toolset, post meta) and a post type\'s fields (postType). A block is bound to a source through its attributes.metadata.bindings, one {source, args} per attribute.'=>'返回区块可从中填充的内容（post、author、site、archive、custom field、product）以及每个来源的字段、此站点上的字段插件（ACF、Meta Box、Pods、JetEngine、Toolset、post meta）和文章类型的字段（postType）。区块通过其 attributes.metadata.bindings 绑定到来源，每个属性对应一个 {source, args}。','Preview a dynamic value (Pro)'=>'预览动态值 (Pro)','Returns what a binding shows on one post (post, source, and field or provider + key, as text|url), to check a binding before or after adding it.'=>'返回绑定在单篇文章上显示的内容（文章、来源以及字段或提供者 + 键，形式为 text|url），用于在添加绑定之前或之后检查它。','Remove a self-hosted font'=>'移除自托管字体','Deletes a self-hosted font family\'s files.'=>'删除自托管字体系列的文件。','List self-hosted fonts'=>'列出自托管字体','Lists the Google fonts this site hosts itself (downloaded once, served from the site, no request to Google).'=>'列出此网站自行托管的 Google 字体（仅下载一次，从本站提供，无需向 Google 发送请求）。','Self-host a font'=>'自行托管字体','Downloads a Google font family (family, weights, italic) and serves it from this site.'=>'下载 Google 字体系列（系列、字重、斜体）并通过本网站提供。','List forms'=>'列出表单','Lists the forms built with the Form block and the form plugins it can embed.'=>'列出使用表单区块构建的表单及其可嵌入的表单插件。','List uploaded icons'=>'列出已上传的图标','Lists the SVG icons uploaded to the icon library, newest first.'=>'列出上传到图标库的 SVG 图标，最新的排在最前。','Upload an icon'=>'上传图标','Adds an SVG icon (name, svg markup) to the icon library; the SVG is sanitised first.'=>'向图标库添加 SVG 图标（名称、svg 标记）；SVG 会先被清理。','Delete an uploaded icon'=>'删除已上传的图标','Removes an uploaded icon; blocks that used it keep their own copy.'=>'移除已上传的图标；曾使用它的区块会保留各自的副本。','Convert a page from another builder (Pro)'=>'从其他构建器转换页面 (Pro)','Converts one page built with Elementor, Divi, Beaver Builder or WPBakery (id) into a new draft made of blocks, keeping its layout, typography, colours and images; the original page is not changed. Answers with the draft and a report of what was converted, approximated or not converted. dryRun converts without saving.'=>'将使用 Elementor、Divi、Beaver Builder 或 WPBakery (id) 构建的页面转换为由区块组成的新草稿，同时保留其版式布局、排版、颜色和图像；原始页面不会发生更改。返回该草稿以及关于哪些内容已转换、近似转换或未转换的报告。dryRun 仅执行转换而不保存。','Convert an export from another builder (Pro)'=>'转换来自其他构建器的导出 (Pro)','Converts an export (builder: elementor, divi, beaver or wpbakery; content: the exported text) into a new draft page made of blocks, optionally copying its images into the media library (media). Answers with the draft and a conversion report.'=>'将导出的内容（builder: elementor、divi、beaver 或 wpbakery；content: 导出的文本）转换为由区块组成的新草稿页面，可选择将其图片复制到媒体库（media）。回复包含该草稿和一份转换报告。','Import a Figma frame (Pro)'=>'导入 Figma 画框 (Pro)','Imports one Figma frame (url: the frame\'s link, with its node-id) into a new draft page made of blocks: auto layout becomes flex and grid containers, text keeps its fonts and sizes, images are copied into the media library. Uses the site\'s own Figma token. Answers with the draft and a conversion report.'=>'将一个 Figma 画框（url：画框的链接及其 node-id）导入到由区块组成的新草稿页面中：自动布局转换为 flex 和 grid 容器，文本保留其字体和字号，图像复制到媒体库中。使用站点自有的 Figma 令牌。回复草稿以及转换报告。','Read the Figma connection (Pro)'=>'阅读 Figma 连接 (Pro)','Returns whether the site has a Figma personal access token, the Figma account it belongs to and its last four characters. The token itself is never returned.'=>'返回该站点是否具有 Figma 个人访问令牌、其所属的 Figma 账户以及其最后四个字符。令牌本身绝不会被返回。','Find pages built with other builders (Pro)'=>'查找使用其他构建器构建的页面 (Pro)','Lists the pages and posts built with Elementor, Divi, Beaver Builder or WPBakery (page, per_page), each with its builder and, when it was converted before, the converted draft.'=>'列出使用 Elementor、Divi、Beaver Builder 或 WPBakery 构建的页面和文章 (page, per_page)，并分别包含其构建器，以及先前转换过的转换草稿。','Read the licence'=>'阅读许可协议','Returns this site\'s Page Builder Sandwich plan, licence state, renewal date and what the plan includes.'=>'返回此网站的 Page Builder Sandwich 方案、许可证状态、续订日期以及该方案包含的内容。','Disconnect from support'=>'断开与支持人员的连接','Disconnects this site from support.'=>'断开此站点与支持服务的连接。','Read the support connection'=>'读取支持连接','Says whether this site is connected to Zinn Digital® support, and as whom.'=>'指示此站点是否已连接至 Zinn Digital® 支持服务，以及所用的身份。','Connect to support'=>'联系支持团队','Connects this site to Zinn Digital® support (name, email, consent).'=>'将此站点连接到 Zinn Digital® 支持团队（姓名、电子邮箱、同意）。','Consent to support diagnostics'=>'同意支持诊断','Records the administrator\'s consent to send diagnostics with support tickets.'=>'记录管理员同意随支持工单发送诊断信息。','True records the administrator\'s consent to send diagnostics with support tickets.'=>'True 记录管理员对在支持工单中发送诊断信息的同意。','Read the site diagnostics'=>'阅读站点诊断信息','Returns the diagnostics a support ticket would carry: versions, active plugins, limits and recent errors.'=>'返回支持工单中将包含的诊断信息：版本、已启用的插件、限制和最近的错误。','Open a support ticket'=>'提交支持工单','Files a support ticket (subject, message, kind, email), with this site\'s diagnostics when the administrator agreed. It never creates a login or sends one.'=>'提交一张支持工单（主题、消息、类型、电子邮件），并在管理员同意时附带此站点的诊断信息。它绝不会创建或发送登录凭据。','The ticket subject (up to 200 characters).'=>'工单主题（最多 200 个字符）。','What happened, or the question.'=>'发生了什么，或问题。','The kind of request; help when omitted.'=>'请求的类型；省略时提供帮助。','Reply address; the connected support email when omitted.'=>'回复地址；留空时使用关联的客服支持电子邮箱。','Name to reply to.'=>'用于回复的姓名。','True attaches this site\'s diagnostics (needs the administrator\'s consent).'=>'True 会附上此站点的诊断信息（需要管理员的同意）。','Start the free Pro trial'=>'开始免费 Pro 试用','Starts the 14-day Page Builder Sandwich Pro trial for this site (no payment needed).'=>'为此站点启动为期 14 天的 Page Builder Sandwich Pro 试用（无需付款）。','Read the cloud library account (Pro)'=>'读取云端媒体库账户 (Pro)','Returns the cloud library\'s storage use, plan quota and team facts.'=>'返回云端媒体库的存储空间用量、套餐配额和团队信息。','List cloud library designs (Pro)'=>'列出云端库设计 (Pro)','Lists the designs saved to the cloud library (kind: section, page or pattern; team: a team\'s library).'=>'列出保存在云端库中的设计（种类：区块、页面或样板；团队：团队的库）。','Save a design to the cloud library (Pro)'=>'保存设计至云端库 (Pro)','Saves block markup (title, kind, markup, styles, tags) to your cloud library or a team\'s; images are packed with it.'=>'将区块标记（标题、类型、标记、样式、标签）保存到您的云端库或团队的库中；图像将随之一同打包。','Delete a cloud library design (Pro)'=>'删除云端模板库设计 (Pro)','Deletes a design from the cloud library.'=>'从云端库中删除设计。','Get a cloud library design (Pro)'=>'获取云库设计 (Pro)','Returns one saved design, ready to insert on this site (its images brought into the media library).'=>'返回一个已保存的设计，可随时插入到此站点（其图像已导入到媒体库中）。','Leave a team (Pro)'=>'退出团队 (Pro)','Leaves the team library this site joined.'=>'退出此站点加入的团队资料库。','Join a team (Pro)'=>'加入团队 (Pro)','Joins a team library with an invite code.'=>'使用邀请码加入团队库。','Stop using your own storage (Pro)'=>'停止使用您自己的存储空间 (Pro)','Removes the bring-your-own storage settings; the plan storage is used again.'=>'移除您自带的存储设置；将重新使用套餐存储。','Read the own-storage settings (Pro)'=>'读取自建存储设置 (Pro)','Returns the bring-your-own R2/S3 storage settings (the secret is never returned).'=>'返回您自备的 R2/S3 存储设置（绝不会返回密钥）。','Use your own storage (Pro)'=>'使用您自己的存储空间 (Pro)','Saves bring-your-own storage: provider (r2 or s3), bucket, region, endpoint, prefix, key_id, secret, enabled.'=>'保存您自己的存储：provider（r2 或 s3）、bucket、region、endpoint、prefix、key_id、secret、enabled。','True stores the cloud library in this bucket.'=>'True 会将云端库存储在此存储桶中。','Storage provider: Cloudflare R2, Amazon S3 or another S3-compatible service.'=>'存储提供商：Cloudflare R2、Amazon S3 或其他兼容 S3 的服务。','S3-compatible endpoint URL.'=>'兼容 S3 的终端节点 URL。','Bucket region.'=>'存储桶区域。','Bucket name.'=>'存储桶名称。','Folder inside the bucket.'=>'存储桶内的文件夹。','Access key ID.'=>'访问密钥 ID。','Secret access key; never returned, and empty keeps the saved one.'=>'私密访问密钥；绝不会被返回，留空则保留已保存的密钥。','True uses path-style bucket URLs.'=>'True 使用路径样式的存储桶 URL。','Test your own storage (Pro)'=>'测试您自己的存储空间（Pro）','Writes, reads and deletes a test object in your own storage and reports each step.'=>'在您自己的存储中写入、读取和删除测试对象，并报告每个步骤。','List library teams (Pro)'=>'列出库团队 (Pro)','Lists the teams this site belongs to or owns.'=>'列出此站点所属或拥有的团队。','Create a library team (Agency)'=>'创建素材库团队（代理）','Creates a team library (name) that other sites can join with an invite code.'=>'创建一个团队库（名称），其他站点可以使用邀请码加入。','Delete a library team (Agency)'=>'删除资料库团队（机构）','Deletes a team and every design in its library.'=>'删除一个团队及其资料库中的所有设计。','Invite a site to a team (Agency)'=>'邀请站点加入团队（代理商）','Creates a single-use invite code (role: read or write; label; days valid). The code is shown once.'=>'创建一个一次性邀请码（角色：读取或写入；标签；有效天数）。该代码仅显示一次。','List team members (Pro)'=>'列出团队成员 (Pro)','Lists the sites in a team and their access.'=>'列出团队中的站点及其访问权限。','Remove a team member (Agency)'=>'移除团队成员（机构）','Removes a site from a team.'=>'从团队中移除站点。','Add a query loop (Pro)'=>'添加查询循环 (Pro)','Adds a query loop with a ready-made card, on a new page (pageTitle, status) or at the end of a post (post): source posts|users|terms|field, postType (product for a shop grid), perPage, columns, orderBy, order, pagination, and live filters [{type: search|taxonomy|meta|sort|price|onsale|instock, taxonomy, key, label, ui}].'=>'在新页面 (pageTitle, status) 或文章末尾 (post) 添加带有现成卡片的查询循环 (query loop)：来源 posts|users|terms|field，postType（商店网格为 product），perPage，columns，orderBy，order，分页以及实时筛选器 [{type: search|taxonomy|meta|sort|price|onsale|instock, taxonomy, key, label, ui}]。','List Lottie animations (Pro)'=>'列出 Lottie 动画 (Pro)','Lists the uploaded Lottie animations.'=>'列出已上传的 Lottie 动画。','Upload a Lottie animation (Pro)'=>'上传 Lottie 动画 (Pro)','Validates a Lottie JSON document (json, name) and publishes it as a static file for the Lottie block.'=>'验证 Lottie JSON 文档 (json, name) 并将其作为静态文件发布给 Lottie 区块。','List the A/B tests and their results (Pro)'=>'列出 A/B 测试及其结果 (Pro)','Lists the A/B tests with each version\'s visitors and conversions, and which one is winning.'=>'列出 A/B 测试以及每个版本的访客数和转化次数，并显示胜出版本。','Create an A/B test (Pro)'=>'创建 A/B 测试（Pro）','Adds a test of two versions of a section to the end of a post (post, name, a, b; split and goal optional).'=>'在文章末尾添加一个分块两个版本的测试（post、name、a、b；split 和 goal 为可选）。','Reset an A/B test\'s results (Pro)'=>'重置 A/B 测试结果 (Pro)','Clears a test\'s counts and starts it again (test).'=>'清除测试的计数并重新启动（测试）。','List the mailing-list connections (Pro)'=>'列出邮件列表连接 (Pro)','Lists the mailing-list services (Mailchimp, Brevo, MailerLite, Kit, ActiveCampaign) and which are connected. Keys are never returned.'=>'列出邮件列表服务（Mailchimp、Brevo、MailerLite、Kit、ActiveCampaign）以及已连接的服务。永远不会返回密钥。','Connect a mailing-list service (Pro)'=>'连接邮件列表服务 (Pro)','Connects a mailing-list service with its API key (service, key; account where the service needs one), or disconnects it with an empty key.'=>'使用其 API 密钥连接邮件列表服务（服务、密钥；如果服务需要，还包括账户），或使用空密钥断开连接。','List a service\'s mailing lists (Pro)'=>'列出服务的邮件列表 (Pro)','Lists the audiences or lists of a connected mailing-list service, for a form\'s subscribe action.'=>'列出已连接的邮件列表服务的受众或列表，用于表单的订阅操作。','Read the cookie consent banner (Pro)'=>'阅读 Cookie 同意横幅 (Pro)','Returns the consent banner: whether it is on, its text and design, the categories, and where it applies.'=>'返回同意横幅：是否开启、其文本和设计、类别以及适用的位置。','Change the cookie consent banner (Pro)'=>'更改 Cookie 同意横幅 (Pro)','Changes the consent banner. While it is on, tracking scripts wait for the visitor\'s consent.'=>'更改同意横幅。启用时，跟踪脚本将等待访客的同意。','True shows the cookie banner.'=>'True 会显示 Cookie 横幅。','ID of the popup used as the banner.'=>'用作横幅的弹出窗口的 ID。','Script handles held back until a visitor consents.'=>'保留到访客同意为止的脚本句柄。','How many days a visitor\'s choice is remembered.'=>'记住访客选择的天数。','True: outside the EU, tracking runs until a visitor opts out.'=>'正确：在 EU 境外，跟踪将一直运行，直到访问者选择停用为止。','Create a starter cookie banner (Pro)'=>'创建入门 Cookie 横幅 (Pro)','Creates a ready-made consent banner design to start from.'=>'创建一个现成的同意横幅设计以供开始。','List the form-builder forms (Pro)'=>'列出表单构建器的表单 (Pro)','Lists every form made with the form builder: the page it is on, its fields and what happens when it is sent.'=>'列出使用表单构建器创建的每个表单：所在页面、包含的字段以及提交时发生的操作。','Create a form (Pro)'=>'创建表单 (Pro)','Creates a form (contact, quote, signup or multi-step: fields, steps, settings and actions such as email, save, webhook or a mailing list), on a new page or at the end of an existing post (post).'=>'在新建页面上或现有文章（post）末尾创建一个表单（联系、报价、注册或分步表单：字段、步骤、设置以及电子邮件、保存、webhook 或邮件列表等操作）。','Change a form (Pro)'=>'更改表单 (Pro)','Changes one form (post, form): settings and actions merge with what is there; fields (and steps) replace the fields.'=>'更改一个表单 (post, form)：设置和操作将与现有内容合并；字段（和步骤）将替换现有字段。','List the animation and interaction settings (Pro)'=>'列出动画和交互设置 (Pro)','Returns every motion setting (entrance animation, its length and delay, scroll effect, hover effect, stay in view, parallax, follow the pointer) with its choices or range, and the site\'s breakpoints.'=>'返回所有动效设置（入场动画、其时长和延迟、滚动效果、悬停效果、保持在视口中、视差、跟随指针）及其选项或范围，以及站点的断点。','Animate a block (Pro)'=>'为区块添加动画 (Pro)','Sets or removes (null) motion settings on one block of a page, found by its path, at a breakpoint (base by default). Works on any block, including core blocks whose HTML is saved in the page. Visitors who ask for reduced motion never see the movement.'=>'在断点处（默认为 base），通过页面中某个区块的路径设置或移除 (null) 该区块的动画设置。适用于任何区块，包括其 HTML 保存在页面中的核心区块。要求减少动画效果的访客将永远不会看到该动画。','List the popups (Pro)'=>'列出弹窗 (Pro)','Lists the popups, slide-ins and bars with their triggers, frequency rules and where they show.'=>'列出弹窗、滑入框和提示条及其触发条件、展示频率规则和显示位置。','Create a popup (Pro)'=>'创建弹出窗口 (Pro)','Creates a popup, slide-in or bar: its content, trigger (exit intent, scroll, time, click), frequency and the pages it shows on.'=>'创建弹窗、滑入框或提示条：其内容、触发条件（退出意图、滚动、时间、点击）、显示频率以及显示的页面。','Change a popup (Pro)'=>'更改弹出窗口 (Pro)','Changes a popup, slide-in or bar (id): content, trigger, frequency or where it shows.'=>'更改弹窗、滑入面板或通告栏 (id)：内容、触发条件、频率或显示位置。','Read form submissions (Pro)'=>'读取表单提交 (Pro)','Lists what visitors sent through the forms that save submissions (form narrows it), a page at a time.'=>'逐頁列出訪客透過儲存提交內容的表單所發送的內容（表單可縮小範圍）。','Read the conversion tracking (Pro)'=>'阅读转化跟踪 (Pro)','Returns the Google Analytics 4, Google Tag Manager and Meta Pixel settings and which clicks and form submissions are sent.'=>'返回 Google Analytics 4、Google Tag Manager 和 Meta Pixel 的设置，以及发送了哪些点击和表单提交。','Change the conversion tracking (Pro)'=>'更改转化跟踪 (Pro)','Changes the Google Analytics 4, Google Tag Manager and Meta Pixel settings and which events are sent.'=>'更改 Google Analytics 4、Google Tag Manager 和 Meta Pixel 的设置以及发送哪些事件。','Google Analytics 4 measurement ID (G-…).'=>'Google Analytics 4 衡量 ID (G-…)。','Google Tag Manager container ID (GTM-…).'=>'Google Tag Manager 容器 ID (GTM-…)。','Meta Pixel ID.'=>'Meta 像素 ID。','True loads these tags on the site.'=>'True 会在站点上加载这些标签。','Event name sent when a form is submitted; generate_lead by default.'=>'提交表单时发送的事件名称；默认为 generate_lead。','Read the legacy migration'=>'阅读传统迁移','Returns the 5.x content conversion\'s progress and report.'=>'返回 5.x 内容转换的进度与报告。','Convert legacy content'=>'转换旧版内容','Starts (or restarts) converting every 5.x page to blocks; each post is backed up first.'=>'开始（或重新开始）将每个 5.x 页面转换为区块；每篇文章都会先进行备份。','Undo the legacy migration'=>'撤消传统迁移','Restores every converted post from its backup.'=>'从备份中恢复每篇已转换的文章。','Read the newsletter connection (Pro)'=>'阅读电子报连接 (Pro)','Says whether a Mailchimp key is saved (the key itself is never returned).'=>'指示是否已保存 Mailchimp 密钥（密钥本身绝不会被返回）。','Connect Mailchimp (Pro)'=>'连接 Mailchimp (Pro)','Saves (or, with an empty value, removes) the Mailchimp API key the newsletter block uses.'=>'保存（或在值为空时移除）简报区块所使用的 Mailchimp API 密钥。','Convert one legacy page'=>'转换一个旧版页面','Converts one 5.x page to blocks (backed up first).'=>'将一个 5.x 页面转换为区块（先进行备份）。','Undo one conversion'=>'撤销一次转换','Restores one converted page from its backup.'=>'从备份中恢复一个已转换的页面。','Read the reviews sources (Pro)'=>'阅读评价来源 (Pro)','Returns the Google and Trustpilot sources the Reviews block shows.'=>'返回评价区块显示的 Google 和 Trustpilot 来源。','Change the reviews sources (Pro)'=>'更改评价来源 (Pro)','Sets the Google place and Trustpilot business the Reviews block reads.'=>'设置评价区块读取的 Google 地点和 Trustpilot 商家。','Refresh reviews now (Pro)'=>'立即刷新评价 (Pro)','Fetches the latest Trustpilot reviews now instead of waiting for the daily refresh.'=>'立即获取最新的 Trustpilot 评价，而不是等待每日刷新。','Read the plugin settings'=>'阅读插件设置','Returns the front-end class prefix, the beta-updates state and whether AI agents (MCP) are allowed.'=>'返回前端类前缀、Beta 版更新状态以及是否允许 AI 代理 (MCP)。','Change the plugin settings'=>'更改插件设置','Changes the front-end class prefix (1 to 8 lowercase letters or digits, starting with a letter) and/or turns AI agents (MCP) on or off (mcp: false removes every ability and the MCP endpoint).'=>'更改前端类前缀（1 到 8 个小写字母或数字，以字母开头）和/或开启或关闭 AI 代理 (MCP)（mcp: false 会移除所有能力及 MCP 端点）。','Add a product block or mini cart (Pro)'=>'添加产品区块或迷你购物车 (Pro)','Adds a WooCommerce block at the end of a post: a product element (part: title, gallery, image, price, rating, excerpt, description, add_to_cart, meta, tabs, related, upsells, sale_badge, stock; productId, or 0 for the product being viewed) or a mini cart (label).'=>'在文章末尾添加一个 WooCommerce 区块：产品元素（部分：title、gallery、image、price、rating、excerpt、description、add_to_cart、meta、tabs、related、upsells、sale_badge、stock；productId，或填 0 表示正在查看的产品）或迷你购物车（label）。','Read the theme builder\'s choices (Pro)'=>'阅读主题生成器的选择 (Pro)','Returns the template types, the display-condition kinds (page, post type, term, archive, search, 404, logged in, role, device, date, time, URL parameter, referrer, language, cart) with their choices on this site (roles, languages, post types, taxonomies), and the block attribute (pbswConditions: {match, rules}) that shows or hides any block.'=>'返回模板类型、显示条件种类（page、post type、term、archive、search、404、logged in、role、device、date、time、URL parameter、referrer、language、cart）及其在此站点上的选项（roles、languages、post types、taxonomies），以及用于显示或隐藏任何区块的区块属性（pbswConditions: {match, rules}）。','List the theme templates (Pro)'=>'列出主题模板 (Pro)','Lists the theme builder\'s templates (header, footer, single, archive, search, 404 and, with WooCommerce, product, shop, cart, checkout, thank-you and My Account): each one\'s type, where it shows (include/exclude rules), priority, status and blocks.'=>'列出主题构建器的模板（页眉、页脚、单篇文章、归档、搜索、404 以及在有 WooCommerce 时的产品、商店、购物车、结账、感谢页面和“我的账户”）：各自的类型、显示位置（包含/排除规则）、优先级、状态和区块。','Create a theme template (Pro)'=>'创建主题模板 (Pro)','Creates a template (title, type) that replaces that part of every matching page, on classic and block themes. Without content it starts from a ready-made design for its type. include/exclude are display-condition rules ({kind, values, key, value, from, to, days}, the kinds this site\'s theme builder offers); priority breaks ties; status publish (live) or draft.'=>'创建一个模板（标题、类型），用于替换经典主题和区块主题中每个匹配页面的相应部分。在没有内容的情况下，它会从该类型的预制设计开始。include/exclude 为显示条件规则（{kind, values, key, value, from, to, days}，即此站点的模板制作器所提供的类型）；priority 用于决胜；status 为 publish（已发布）或 draft。','Delete a theme template (Pro)'=>'删除主题模板 (Pro)','Moves one template (id) to the trash; the theme\'s own design shows again where it applied. Restorable from the trash.'=>'将一个模板（id）移至回收站；主题自身的设计将重新在其应用的位置显示。可从回收站恢复。','Change a theme template (Pro)'=>'更改主题模板 (Pro)','Changes one template (id): any of title, type, content (block markup), include, exclude, priority, status. Only what you send changes.'=>'更改一个模板 (id)：标题、类型、内容（区块标记）、包含、排除、优先级、状态中的任意一项。仅您发送的内容会发生更改。','Export designs and settings'=>'导出设计与设置','Exports the chosen templates and patterns (ids) and, optionally, settings as one package for another site.'=>'将所选模板和样板 (ids) 以及可选的设置导出为适用于另一个网站的单个包。','Import designs and settings'=>'导入设计和设置','Imports a Page Builder Sandwich design package (dryRun first to see what would change; mode: skip or replace; media; settings).'=>'导入 Page Builder Sandwich 设计包（请先运行 dryRun 查看将发生的更改；mode：skip 或 replace；media；settings）。','List what can be exported'=>'列出可导出的内容','Lists the templates, patterns and settings that can be exported to another site.'=>'列出可以导出到其他站点的模板、样板和设置。','Read maintenance mode (Pro)'=>'读取维护模式 (Pro)','Returns maintenance / coming-soon mode: mode, page, retry-after and which roles still see the site.'=>'返回维护/即将推出模式：模式、页面、retry-after 以及仍可查看该站点的角色。','Change maintenance mode (Pro)'=>'更改维护模式 (Pro)','Turns maintenance (503) or coming-soon mode on or off (mode), with the page to show (page_id), retry_after and the roles that bypass it.'=>'开启或关闭维护 (503) 或即将推出模式 (mode)，包含要显示的页面 (page_id)、retry_after 以及绕过该模式的角色。','List find-and-replace jobs (Pro)'=>'列出查找和替换任务 (Pro)','Lists the site-wide find-and-replace jobs and their state.'=>'列出全站查找和替换任务及其状态。','Find and replace across the site (Pro)'=>'在全站查找并替换 (Pro)','Starts a block-safe find-and-replace (find, replace, kind: text, link or colour; match_case; types). Nothing changes until the previewed job is applied.'=>'启动区块安全查找与替换（查找、替换、种类：文本、链接或颜色；match_case；类型）。在应用预览的任务之前，不会更改任何内容。','Preview a find-and-replace (Pro)'=>'预览查找和替换 (Pro)','Returns a job\'s matches, page by page, to review before applying.'=>'逐页返回职位的匹配项，以便在申请前进行审核。','Apply a find-and-replace (Pro)'=>'应用查找和替换 (Pro)','Applies a previewed job. Every changed post keeps a backup, so the job can be undone.'=>'应用已预览的任务。每个更改的文章都会保留备份，因此可以撤消该任务。','Undo a find-and-replace (Pro)'=>'撤销查找和替换 (Pro)','Restores the posts a job changed (a post edited since keeps its edit).'=>'恢复作业更改的文章（自那以后编辑过的文章将保留其编辑内容）。','Read builder permissions (Pro)'=>'读取构建器权限 (Pro)','Returns which roles may use the builder, design, code and templates (client mode).'=>'返回哪些角色可以使用构建器、设计、代码和模板（客户端模式）。','Change builder permissions (Pro)'=>'更改构建器权限 (Pro)','Sets per role what the builder allows (roles), e.g. a content-only client role.'=>'按角色设置构建器允许的操作（角色），例如仅用于内容的客户角色。','Read white label (Agency)'=>'读取白标（代理）','Returns the white-label settings: on or off, the name shown and which users still see the original.'=>'返回白标设置：开启或关闭、显示的名称以及哪些用户仍会看到原始名称。','Change white label (Agency)'=>'更改白标（代理）','Turns white label on or off and sets the name clients see (enabled, name, agency_users).'=>'开启或关闭白标，并设置客户看到的名称 (enabled, name, agency_users)。','True turns white label on.'=>'True 开启白标。','The builder\'s name shown to clients.'=>'向客户显示的构建器名称。','The agency\'s name.'=>'代理机构名称。','Author shown on the Plugins screen.'=>'在“插件”页面上显示的作者。','Author website URL.'=>'作者网站 URL。','Plugin description shown to clients.'=>'向客户显示的插件描述。','Menu icon: a dashicons-* name or an image URL.'=>'菜单图标：dashicons-* 名称或图像 URL。','True hides the plugin from clients\' Plugins screen.'=>'True 会在客户的“插件”屏幕中隐藏该插件。','IDs of the users who always see the real plugin.'=>'始终能看到实际插件的用户的 ID。','Build several pages'=>'创建多个页面','Creates up to 50 pages in one call, each from sections and/or block content. Each page is checked and created on its own; the answer lists every page made and every one refused, with the reason.'=>'在一次调用中最多创建 50 个页面，每个页面均由分段和/或区块内容组成。每个页面都经过单独检查和创建；回复会列出已创建的每个页面以及被拒绝的每个页面及其原因。','Write a page with AI'=>'使用 AI 撰写页面','Builds a page from sections (given, or chosen by AI from the section library) and has AI rewrite all of its text for your brief, keeping the design. Uses the AI provider set up in the plugin\'s AI settings. The page is a draft unless another status is asked for.'=>'通过各个区块（给定的，或由 AI 从区块库中选择的）构建页面，并在保留设计的同时让 AI 根据您的需求简报重写其所有文本。使用在插件的 AI 设置中配置的 AI 提供商。除非要求其他状态，否则该页面为草稿。','What the page is for: the business, the offer, the audience and the tone.'=>'该页面的用途：业务、优惠、受众和语气。','Send between 1 and %d pages.'=>'发送 1 到 %d 页。','Describe the page in at least a sentence.'=>'请至少用一句话描述该页面。','The AI did not choose any section from the library. Name the sections yourself, or try a more detailed brief.'=>'人工智能未从库中选择任何版块。请您自行命名版块，或尝试提供更详细的说明。','The AI rewrote %1$d of the page\'s %2$d pieces of text, so nothing was saved. Try again.'=>'AI 重写了页面 %2$d 处文本中的 %1$d 处，因此未保存任何内容。请重试。','A migration step is running right now. Try again in a minute.'=>'迁移步骤正在运行中。请在一分钟后重试。','Say what to change (up to 2,000 characters).'=>'请说明要更改的内容（最多 2,000 个字符）。','That block is not on the page.'=>'该区块不在页面上。','No text was given.'=>'未提供文本。','Only a block without blocks inside it holds text of its own.'=>'仅内部没有区块的区块才包含其自身的文本。','No settings were given.'=>'未提供任何设置。','%2$s has no setting called "%1$s".'=>'%2$s没有名为“%1$s”的设置。','The place to put it is not on the page.'=>'放置它的位置不在页面上。','A block cannot be moved inside itself.'=>'区块不能移动到其自身内部。','This block saves its design in the page\'s HTML, so its settings can be changed only in the editor.'=>'此区块将其设计保存在页面的 HTML 中，因此其设置只能在编辑器中更改。','Unknown operation.'=>'未知操作。','The text of this block can be changed only in the editor.'=>'该区块的文本只能在编辑器中更改。','Edit a page with the AI assistant'=>'使用 AI 助手编辑页面','Changes a page as asked in plain words ("make the hero text shorter", "add an FAQ about delivery after the pricing", "translate the page into German"). AI answers with edit operations that are checked against the page\'s blocks and their settings before anything is applied; refused operations are listed with the reason. A revision is saved first and its id returned as undo_revision.'=>'按照通俗易懂的文字要求更改页面（例如“缩短主横幅文字”、“在定价后添加关于配送的常见问题”、“将页面翻译成德语”）。AI 会返回编辑操作，在应用任何更改之前，这些操作都会根据页面的区块及其设置进行检查；被拒绝的操作会连同原因一起列出。系统会先保存一个修订版本，并将其 id 作为 undo_revision 返回。','Plan a website with AI'=>'使用 AI 规划网站','From a description of the business, lists the pages a website needs (home first, contact last), each with a title and a brief for that page. Nothing is created; each page can then be built from its brief.'=>'根据业务描述，列出网站所需的页面（首页在先，联系页面在后），每个页面均包含标题和简要概述。不会创建任何内容；随后可根据各自的简要概述来构建每个页面。','Create a custom block with AI'=>'使用 AI 创建自定义区块','Designs a reusable component from a description (a pricing card, a team card, a banner) and saves it as a synced pattern in the editor\'s "My patterns", with each text overridable per placement. Returns its id and the block that places it.'=>'根据描述设计可复用组件（价格卡片、团队卡片、横幅），并将其另存为编辑器“我的样板”中的同步样板，且每个文本均可在各处放置时单独替代。返回其 id 以及放置它的区块。','Design a page from a screenshot or a link with AI'=>'通过 AI 从屏幕截图或链接设计页面','Recreates the layout of a screenshot (an image in the media library) or of a public web page (its address) as editable blocks in a new draft page: the same sections, columns, headings, text, lists and buttons. Logos and images are not copied.'=>'将屏幕截图（媒体库中的图像）或公开网页（其地址）的布局在新的草稿页面中重新创建为可编辑区块：相同的分区、栏目、标题、文本、列表和按钮。徽标和图像不会被复制。','Generate an image with AI'=>'使用 AI 生成图像','Creates an image from a description with the site\'s image model (OpenAI or Google) and saves it to the media library with alt text. Returns its id and address.'=>'使用站点的图像模型（OpenAI 或 Google）根据描述创建图像，并将其与替代文本一同保存至媒体库。返回其 id 和地址。','Explain, write or fix CSS with AI'=>'利用 AI 解释、编写或修复 CSS','Explains, writes or fixes the custom CSS of one element, where `selector` stands for the element. Returns the CSS and an explanation; nothing is saved.'=>'解释、编写或修复单个元素的自定义 CSS，其中 `selector` 代表该元素。返回 CSS 和说明；不保存任何内容。','Check a page\'s accessibility'=>'检查页面的无障碍性','Lists a page\'s accessibility problems: images without alt text, headings that skip a level, links whose text says nothing on its own, and links with no text. Each says whether it can be fixed automatically.'=>'列出页面的无障碍问题：没有替代文本的图像、跨级别的标题、文本本身没有明确意义的链接以及没有文本的链接。每项都会指出是否可以自动修复。','Fix a page\'s accessibility with AI'=>'利用 AI 修复页面无障碍性','Fixes the accessibility problems that can be fixed (all, or the listed issue ids): alt text written by looking at each image, heading levels corrected, vague link texts rewritten. A revision is saved first and its id returned as undo_revision.'=>'修复可以修复的无障碍问题（全部，或列出的问题 ID）：通过查看每个图像编写的替代文本、更正的标题级别、重写的不明确的链接文本。首先保存修订版本，并将其 ID 作为 undo_revision 返回。','Describe the business in at least a sentence (up to 4,000 characters).'=>'请至少用一句话描述该业务（最多 4,000 个字符）。','The AI did not plan any page. Try a more detailed brief.'=>'AI 未规划任何页面。请尝试提供更详细的简要说明。','Describe the block in a sentence (up to 2,000 characters).'=>'用一句话描述该区块（最多 2,000 个字符）。','Heading'=>'标题','Text'=>'文本','New design'=>'新设计','That is not an image you may use.'=>'那不是您可以使用的图像。','Use a PNG, JPEG, GIF or WebP screenshot.'=>'请使用 PNG、JPEG、GIF 或 WebP 格式的屏幕截图。','The screenshot is too large (5 MB at most).'=>'屏幕截图过大（最多 5 MB）。','Give a full web address starting with https://, or choose a screenshot.'=>'请输入以 https:// 开头的完整网址，或选择屏幕截图。','That page could not be read. Check the address, or use a screenshot instead.'=>'无法读取该页面。请检查地址，或改用屏幕截图。','That page has no readable text (it may be built in the browser). Use a screenshot instead.'=>'该页面没有可读取的文本（它可能是在浏览器中构建的）。请改用屏幕截图。','Unknown CSS helper action.'=>'未知的 CSS 辅助操作。','There is no CSS to explain or fix yet.'=>'尚无可解释或修复的 CSS。','Say what the CSS should do.'=>'说明 CSS 应该执行的操作。','That is too much CSS for one request.'=>'单个请求中的 CSS 过多。','The AI wrote CSS the builder refuses to use (it could break out of the style sheet or load something). Try again.'=>'人工智能生成的 CSS 样式未能被编辑器采用（它可能会破坏样式表结构或加载未知资源）。请重试。','Describe the image in a sentence (up to 4,000 characters).'=>'请用一句话描述此图像（最多 4,000 个字符）。','The AI did not return an image. Try again, or choose another image model in the AI settings.'=>'AI 未返回图像。请重试，或在 AI 设置中选择其他图像模型。','The AI planned an empty layout. Try again, or describe it in more detail.'=>'人工智能规划了一个空白布局。请重试，或更详细地对其进行描述。','Rated %s out of 5'=>'满分 5 星中获得 %s 星','Adults only: %d and over'=>'仅限成人：%d 岁及以上','Pros'=>'优点','Cons'=>'缺点','%1$s out of %2$s'=>'%1$s / %2$s','Claim offer'=>'领取优惠','New customers only. Terms and conditions apply.'=>'仅限新客户。适用条款和条件。','Rank'=>'排名','Operator'=>'运算符','Bonus'=>'奖金','Rating'=>'评分','Highlights'=>'亮点','Visit'=>'访问','New customers only. Terms and conditions apply. Please gamble responsibly.'=>'仅限新客户。适用条款和条件。请理性博彩。','%s in 24 hours'=>'24 小时内%s','Prices will appear here shortly.'=>'价格很快将在此处显示。','Prices from CoinGecko, updated %s'=>'价格来自 CoinGecko，更新于 %s','Cryptocurrency prices'=>'加密货币价格','%1$s: %2$s