户可以查看该文件。','Figma is limiting requests from your account right now. Wait a minute and try again.'=>'Figma 目前正在限制来自您账户的请求。请稍候一分钟后再试。','Figma answered with an error (%d). Try again in a few minutes.'=>'Figma 返回了错误（%d）。请在几分钟后重试。','A drawing could not be exported from Figma, so it was left out.'=>'无法从 Figma 导出图纸，因此将其略过。','Not converted: Figma "%s" layers have no equivalent.'=>'未转换：Figma“%s”图层没有对应的等效项。','Layers placed freely (overlapping) in Figma were stacked; layers that sat on top of each other are now one after another.'=>'在 Figma 中自由放置（重叠）的图层已堆叠；原本相互重叠的图层现在依次排列。','That page does not exist.'=>'该页面不存在。','This page was not built with Elementor, Divi, Beaver Builder or WPBakery, so there is nothing to convert.'=>'此页面不是使用 Elementor、Divi、Beaver Builder 或 WPBakery 构建的，因此无需转换任何内容。','Choose Elementor, Divi, Beaver Builder or WPBakery.'=>'请选择 Elementor、Divi、Beaver Builder 或 WPBakery。','Nothing could be read from that export. Check it is the whole file, from the builder you chose.'=>'无法从该导出的文件中读取任何内容。请检查其是否为您所选构建器的完整文件。','Imported page'=>'导入的页面','An image could not be copied into the media library, so it still loads from the original site.'=>'无法将图像复制到媒体库中，因此它仍会从原始网站加载。','More images than one import copies; the rest still load from the original site.'=>'图片数量超出了一次导入所能复制的范围；其余图片仍将从原网站加载。','Kept as a shortcode: %s shows only while the plugin that provides it is active.'=>'保留為簡碼：%s 僅在提供它的外掛程式處於啟用狀態時顯示。','A parallax or video background became a still background.'=>'视差或视频背景已变为静态背景。','A column offset became a start margin.'=>'列偏移变为了起始外边距。','Image #%d is not in this site\'s media library; add it again.'=>'图像 #%d 不在此站点的媒体库中；请重新添加。','Text on the button'=>'按钮上的文本','The separator\'s title became a heading above the line.'=>'分隔符的标题变成了线上方的标题。','The pie chart became a number with its label.'=>'饼图变成了带有标签的数字。','Raw JavaScript was not imported (scripts are not copied into page content); add it again with a code snippet tool if you still need it.'=>'未导入原始 JavaScript（脚本不会复制到页面内容中）；如果您仍需要它，请使用代码片段工