式模式、过大的原始图像以及无页面使用的设计类。以简短的步骤运行：在状态为“scanning”时，每次运行都会从上次停止的地方继续；重新启动则会从头开始。','Clean up what the site health report found'=>'清理站点健康报告发现的问题','Cleans one kind of finding: revisions (keeps each post\'s newest 5, deletes older ones), patterns (moves unused synced patterns to the trash), images (a scaled copy WordPress uses; the original is kept), classes (removes unused design classes, kept for restoring). Each run cleans one batch; "more" is true while findings remain.'=>'清理一种发现结果：修订版本（保留每篇文章最新的 5 个，删除较旧的）、样式（将未使用的已同步样式移至回收站）、图像（WordPress 使用的缩放副本；原件予以保留）、类（移除未使用的设计类，予以保留以便恢复）。每次运行清理一批；只要仍有发现结果，"more" 即为 true。','Unknown clean-up.'=>'未知的清理。','Run the site health report first; a clean-up only removes what the report found.'=>'请先运行站点健康报告；清理操作只会移除该报告所发现的内容。','You may not edit this image.'=>'您不能编辑此图像。','This image cannot be scaled.'=>'该图像无法缩放。','A scaled copy would not be smaller.'=>'缩放后的副本不会更小。','That template type does not exist on this site.'=>'该模板类型在此站点上不存在。','The template could not be saved.'=>'无法保存模板。','The template could not be moved to the trash.'=>'无法将模板移至回收站。','That post does not exist.'=>'该文章不存在。','List'=>'列表','Activate WooCommerce first.'=>'请先激活 WooCommerce。','You cannot create pages.'=>'您无法创建页面。','Entire site'=>'整个站点','Front page'=>'首页','Specific posts or pages'=>'特定文章或页面','In a category or tag'=>'在分类或标签中','Search results'=>'搜索结果','Page not found (404)'=>'页面未找到 (404)','Logged in or out'=>'已登录或已退出','User role'=>'用户角色','Device'=>'设备','Date range'=>'日期范围','Time of day'=>'一天中的时间','URL parameter'=>'URL 参数','Referrer'=>'来源','Language'=>'语言','Cart contents'=>'购物车内容','%1$s; except: %2$s'=>'%1$s；除外：%2$s','The page you were looking for is not here. Try a search instead.'=>'您寻找的页面不存在。请尝试搜索。','Thank you for your order'=>'感谢您的订购','Design this template with any blocks.'=>'使用任意区块设计此模板。','Header'=>'页眉','Footer'=>'页脚','Single post or page'=>'单篇文章或页面','Archive (category, tag, author, blog)'=>'归档（分类、标签、作者、博客）','Theme templates'=>'主题模板','Theme template'=>'主题模板','Add template'=>'添加模