e saved.'=>'无法保存。','Before you contact support'=>'联系支持团队之前','Your request is sent from this site to %s, who make this plugin. We send:'=>'您的请求已从此站点发送至此插件的开发者 %s。我们发送的内容包括：','your e-mail address and name, so we can reply;'=>'您的电子邮件地址和姓名，以便我们回复；','the subject and message you write;'=>'您撰写的主题与内容；','your licence ID, so paying customers get priority;'=>'您的许可证 ID，以便付费客户获得优先支持；','only if you tick it: site details (WordPress and PHP versions, theme, plugins, an excerpt of the error log with passwords and e-mail addresses removed), which you can read before sending;'=>'仅在您勾选时：站点详情（WordPress 和 PHP 版本、主题、插件，以及已移除密码和电子邮件地址的错误日志摘录），您可以在发送前阅读；','I agree, continue'=>'我同意，继续','The connection could not be checked.'=>'无法检查连接。','That did not work. Try again.'=>'操作未成功。请重试。','Zinn Digital® support disconnected this site.'=>'Zinn Digital® 支持团队已断开此站点的连接。','Zinn Digital® support no longer recognises this site.'=>'Zinn Digital® 支持团队不再识别此站点。','You disconnected this site.'=>'您已断开此站点的连接。','Connect this site to support'=>'将此站点连接到支持团队','Connected. Replies go to %s.'=>'已连接。回复将发送至 %s。','Not connected. You can still send a request with your e-mail address below; connecting saves typing it each time.'=>'未连接。您仍可以在下方使用您的电子邮件地址发送请求；连接后无需每次都输入。','E-mail address'=>'电子邮箱地址','Your name (optional)'=>'您的姓名（选填）','I agree to connect this site to Zinn Digital® support. It sends this site’s address, WordPress and PHP versions and the plugin version, and can be disconnected at any time from here or by Zinn Digital®.'=>'我同意将此站点连接到 Zinn Digital® 支持。这会发送此站点的地址、WordPress 和 PHP 版本以及插件版本，并且可以随时从此处或由 Zinn Digital® 断开连接。','Connect'=>'连接','I need help'=>'我需要帮助','Report a bug'=>'报告错误','Send feedback'=>'发送反馈','Request a feature'=>'请求新功能','The site details could not be read.'=>'无法读取站点详细信息。','Your request could not be sent. Try again in a few minutes.'=>'您的请求无法发送。请在几分钟后重试。','Feedback and feature requests'=>'反馈与功能建议','Sent. Your reference is %s, and our reply will come by e-mail.'=>'已发送。您的参考编号是 %s，我们的回复将通过电子邮件发送。','What is it 