or help or report a bug'=>'寻求帮助或报告错误','Describe what happened. You choose whether to attach site information, and you can see exactly what it contains first.'=>'请描述发生了什么。您可以选择是否附上站点信息，并且可以先确切查看其中包含的内容。','Tell us what to build'=>'告诉我们您希望构建什么','Send an idea, a feature request or any feedback. It goes straight to the team.'=>'发送想法、功能请求或任何反馈。它将直接送达团队。','This takes a few minutes and sets up %s so it works on this site straight away. You can change everything later.'=>'这需要几分钟时间，并将配置 %s 使其立即在此站点上运行。您稍后可以更改所有内容。','You are ready. If anything does not work as expected, we are one click away.'=>'您已准备就绪。如果任何内容未能按预期运行，我们随时只需一次点击即可为您提供帮助。','Step %1$d of %2$d: %3$s'=>'步骤 %1$d / %2$d：%3$s','Finish'=>'完成','Skip setup'=>'跳过设置','Import “%s”'=>'导入“%s”','%d page imported.'=>'已导入 %d 个页面。','edit'=>'编辑','Pages to import'=>'要导入的页面','Publish the pages now (otherwise they are saved as drafts)'=>'立即发布页面（否则将保存为草稿）','Use the kit’s home page as the site’s front page'=>'将套件的主页用作站点的主页','Create a menu with the imported pages'=>'使用导入的页面创建菜单','Importing never changes your existing pages. Importing the same kit again updates the pages it created before.'=>'导入绝不会更改您现有的页面。再次导入相同的套件会更新其之前创建的页面。','Import'=>'导入','Complete websites you can import in one click: pages, sections and a menu, ready for your own words and pictures. Kits come from Zinn Digital® and new ones are added every month.'=>'您可以一键导入的完整网站：页面、版块和菜单，随时可供您填入自己的文字和图片。这些套件由 Zinn Digital® 提供，且每月都会新增。','Search kits'=>'搜索套件','Category'=>'分类','All categories'=>'所有分类','Free and Pro'=>'免费版和专业版','Go Pro to import'=>'升级到 Pro 即可导入','No kit matches these filters.'=>'没有与这些筛选条件匹配的套件。','My library'=>'我的媒体库','Team'=>'团队','Storage'=>'存储','Your library is kept in your own storage bucket, so no Zinn Digital® quota applies.'=>'您的媒体库保存在您自己的存储桶中，因此不适用任何 Zinn Digital® 配额。','%1$s of %2$s used (%3$d%%)'=>'已使用 %2$s 中的 %1$s (%3$d%%)','%1$d of %2$d designs · up to %3$s per design · images are resized to 2560 px and stored once'=>'%1$d / %2$d 个设计 · 每个设计上限 %3$s · 图像尺寸调整为 2560 px 并仅存储一次','Deleted from your library.'=>'已从您的媒体库中删除。','Save any section or page from the editor: open the block’s ⋮ menu and choose “Save to cloud library”. Insert saved designs from the Cloud library panel in the editor, on any of your sites.'=>'从编辑器保存任何部分或页面：打开区块的 ⋮ 菜单并选择“保存到云端库”。在您的任何站点上，从编辑器的云端库面板插入已保存的设计。','Show'=>'显示','Everything'=>'全部','Sections'=>'区块','Styles'=>'样式','Size'=>'大小','Nothing saved yet.'=>'尚未保存任何内容。','Delete'=>'删除','Write a test file'=>'写入测试文件','Read it back'=>'重新朗读','Delete it'=>'删除它','In your Cloudflare dashboard, open R2 Object Storage and create a bucket (for example “my-pbs-library”). Keep it private: do not connect a public domain.'=>'在您的 Cloudflare 控制面板中，打开 R2 Object Storage 并创建一个存储桶（例如“my-pbs-library”）。请保持其私有状态：不要连接公共域名。','Open “Manage API tokens” in R2 and create an API token with “Object Read & Write” permission, limited to that one bucket.'=>'在 R2 中打开“管理 API 令牌”，并创建一个具有“对象读写”权限的 API 令牌，权限仅限于该存储桶。','Copy the Access Key ID and the Secret Access Key it shows (the secret is shown only once).'=>'请复制显示的访问密钥 ID 和秘密访问密钥（该秘密仅显示一次）。','Copy the S3 endpoint for your account. It looks like https://<account-id>.r2.cloudflarestorage.com. Region is “auto”.'=>'复制您账户的 S3 端点。其格式类似于 https://<account-id>.r2.cloudflarestorage.com。区域为“auto”。','Paste the values below, save, then press “Test connection”. Switch the library to your storage only when the test passes.'=>'请在下方粘贴这些值，保存，然后按“测试连接”。仅在测试通过后才将媒体库切换到您的存储空间。','Create a private bucket with your provider (Amazon S3, Backblaze B2, Wasabi, MinIO or any S3-compatible service).'=>'请在您的提供商（Amazon S3、Backblaze B2、Wasabi、MinIO 或任何兼容 S3 的服务）处创建一个私有存储桶。','Create an access key that can read, write and delete objects in that bucket only.'=>'创建一个仅能读取、写入和删除该存储桶中对象的访问密钥。','Find the S3 endpoint (for Amazon S3: %s) and the bucket’s region.'=>'查找 S3 端点（对于 Amazon S3：%s）和存储桶的区域。','Amazon S3 uses virtual-hosted addresses: switch off “Path-style addresses”. Most other services use path-style.'=>'Amazon S3 使用虚拟托管地址：请关闭“Path-style addresses”。大多数其他服务使用路径样式。','Paste the values below, save, then press “Test connection”.'=>'请在下方粘贴这些值，保存，然后按“测试连接”。','Storage settings saved.'=>'存储设置已保存。','Your cloud library is kept in Zinn Digital® storage with the space your plan includes. You can keep it in your own Cloudflare R2 or S3-compatible bucket instead: then no Zinn Digital® quota applies, and every site you connect to the same bucket shares the library. Team libraries always use Zinn Digital® storage.'=>'您的云端资源库保存在 Zinn Digital® 存储空间中，使用您方案所包含的容量。您也可以将其保存在您自己的 Cloudflare R2 或兼容 S3 的存储桶中：这样就不会受到 Zinn Digital® 配额的限制，并且您连接到同一存储桶的每个站点都会共享该资源库。团队资源库始终使用 Zinn Digital® 存储空间。','Connect your own storage: step by step'=>'连接您自己的存储空间：分步指南','Another S3-compatible service'=>'其他兼容 S3 的服务','Read the full guide'=>'阅读完整指南','S3 endpoint'=>'S3 端点','Bucket'=>'存储桶','Region'=>'地区','Cloudflare R2: auto.'=>'Cloudflare R2：自动。','Access key ID'=>'访问密钥 ID','Stored. Leave empty to keep it.'=>'已存储。留空以保留它。','Secret access key'=>'秘密访问密钥','Stored encrypted on this site and never shown again. Leave empty to keep it.'=>'加密儲存在此網站上，且不會再顯示。留空以保留它。','Stored encrypted on this site. It is never sent to Zinn Digital®.'=>'加密存储于本站点。绝不会发送至 Zinn Digital®。','Path-style addresses'=>'路径样式地址','Folder in the bucket'=>'存储桶中的文件夹','Save'=>'保存','Test connection'=>'测试连接','Remove these settings'=>'移除这些设置','Keep my library in this storage'=>'将我的媒体库保留在此存储空间中','The connection test passed.'=>'连接测试通过。','Run “Test connection” first.'=>'请先运行“测试连接”。','Invite a site'=>'邀请站点','Who is it for? (optional)'=>'这是给谁的？（可选）','Access'=>'访问','Use designs (read only)'=>'使用设计（只读）','Use and save designs'=>'使用并保存设计','Create invite code'=>'创建邀请码','Give this code to the site owner. It works once, for 7 days, and is shown only now:'=>'请将此代码提供给站点所有者。它仅能使用一次，有效期为 7 天，且仅在此时显示：','Copy'=>'复制','Members'=>'成员','No site has joined yet.'=>'尚无站点加入。','use and save'=>'使用并保存','read only'=>'只读','Delete team'=>'删除团队','Delete this team and every design in its library?'=>'删除此团队及其库中的所有设计？','This site joined the team library.'=>'此站点已加入团队资料库。','This site uses the team library:'=>'此站点正在使用团队库：','Leave'=>'离开','Join a team with an invite code'=>'使用邀请码加入团队','Join'=>'加入','Your teams'=>'您的团队','New team name'=>'新团队名称','Create team'=>'创建团队','Creating team libraries comes with the Agency plan.'=>'创建团队资源库包含在 Agency 方案中。','Save sections, pages and styles to your cloud library and reuse them on all your sites. Agencies can share a library with their team and clients. You can keep the library in Zinn Digital® storage or in your own Cloudflare R2 or S3-compatible bucket.'=>'将板块、页面和样式保存到您的云端库中，并在您的所有站点上重复使用它们。代理机构可以与他们的团队和客户共享库。您可以将库保存在 Zinn Digital® 存储中，或保存在您自己的 Cloudflare R2 或兼容 S3 的存储桶中。','Get Page Builder Sandwich Pro'=>'获取 Page Builder Sandwich Pro','Website kits'=>'网站套件','Cloud library'=>'云端库','Built by Neil Lock, CEO of Zinn Digital® Ltd'=>'由 Zinn Digital® Ltd 首席执行官 Neil Lock 构建','Version %s'=>'版本 %s','Page Builder Sandwich website'=>'Page Builder Sandwich 网站','Zinn Digital® website'=>'Zinn Digital® 网站','Settings saved.'=>'设置已保存。','See the Pro plans and pricing'=>'查看 Pro 方案与价格','Front-end output'=>'前端输出','Class name prefix'=>'类名前缀','Every class name the plugin prints on your pages starts with this prefix, so the pages do not reveal which plugin built them. 1 to 8 lowercase letters or digits, starting with a letter.'=>'该插件在您的页面上输出的每个类名均以此前缀开头，这样页面就不会透露是由哪个插件构建的。1 到 8 个小写字母或数字，以字母开头。','Beta updates'=>'测试版更新','This site receives beta versions as updates.'=>'此站点接收 Beta 版本作为更新。','This site receives stable versions only.'=>'此站点仅接收稳定版本。','Change this on the Account page'=>'在“账户”页面上更改此项','Beta versions are offered to licensed Pro installations that are connected to their account. Once connected, you can join from the Account page.'=>'Beta 版本提供给已连接到其账户的授权 Pro 安装。连接后，您可以在“账户”页面加入。','Breakpoints saved. Pages pick up the new widths on their next view.'=>'断点已保存。页面将在下次查看时采用新的宽度。','Breakpoints'=>'断点','Styles set for Tablet apply up to the tablet width, and styles set for Mobile up to 