o ask their device for less motion see the text still.'=>'当文本滚动到可视区域时播放一次。在其设备上请求减少动态效果的访客将看到静止的文本。','Speed'=>'速度','Slow'=>'慢','Normal'=>'正常','Fast'=>'快速','Write the text to animate…'=>'输入要制作动画的文本…','Audio player'=>'音频播放器','Show or album name'=>'演出或专辑名称','Replace artwork'=>'替换封面图','Choose artwork'=>'选择插图','Add an episode'=>'添加剧集','Choose audio file'=>'选择音频文件','Replace audio file'=>'替换音频文件','or its address'=>'或其地址','Add episodes in the sidebar.'=>'在侧边栏中添加剧集。','Author box'=>'作者框','Picture size (pixels)'=>'图像大小（像素）','Link to the author’s posts'=>'链接到作者的文章','Link to their website'=>'链接到他们的网站','Name as'=>'命名为','Heading 2'=>'标题 2','Heading 3'=>'标题 3','Heading 4'=>'标题 4','Paragraph'=>'段落','The author of the post shows here.'=>'文章的作者显示在此处。','Read out by screen readers, and shown when “Show label” is on.'=>'由屏幕阅读器朗读，并在启用“显示标签”时显示。','Show label'=>'显示标签','Corner'=>'角','End (right in English)'=>'末尾（英文中为右）','Start (left in English)'=>'开始（保留英文）','Appear after scrolling (pixels)'=>'滚动后显示（像素）','Before: alternative text'=>'之前：替代文本','Before: label'=>'前：标签','After: alternative text'=>'后：替代文本','After: label'=>'之后：标签','Slider'=>'滑块','Starting position (%)'=>'起始位置 (%)','Before and after'=>'之前和之后','Choose the two images in the block settings. Use images of the same size.'=>'请在区块设置中选择两张图像。请使用相同尺寸的图像。','Start with the home page'=>'从主页开始','Home page label'=>'主页标签','Separator'=>'分隔符','Chevron ›'=>'燕尾形 ›','Slash /'=>'斜杠 /','Arrow →'=>'箭头 →','Dot ·'=>'点 ·','End with the current page'=>'在当前页面结束','Structured data for search engines'=>'面向搜索引擎的结构化数据','Adds BreadcrumbList data to the page. Turn it off if an SEO plugin already adds breadcrumb data.'=>'向页面添加 BreadcrumbList 数据。如果 SEO 插件已添加面包屑导航数据，请将其关闭。','The path to the current page shows here. The home page has none.'=>'当前页面的路径显示在此处。主页没有任何路径。','Remove these hours on %s'=>'删除 %s 的这些营业时间','Add hours (for a break)'=>'添加小时（用于休息）','Copy Monday to Tuesday–Friday'=>'将周一复制到周二至周五','Hours that end after midnight (18:00 to 02:00) belong to the day they start. T