conds'=>'显示秒数','Choose the date and time it counts down to.'=>'请选择倒计时截止的日期和时间。','Counter'=>'计数器','Count to'=>'计数至','Count from'=>'起始计数值','Decimal places'=>'小数位数','Before the number'=>'数字前面','For example "$".'=>'例如“$”。','After the number'=>'在数字之后','For example "+" or "%".'=>'例如“+”或“%”。','Thousands separator'=>'千位分隔符','Counting time (milliseconds)'=>'计数时间（毫秒）','Set the number to count to.'=>'设置要计数的数字。','Coupon code'=>'优惠券代码','Expires'=>'过期时间','As you want it shown, for example "31 December".'=>'按照您希望显示的方式，例如“12月31日”。','Enter the code in the block settings.'=>'请在区块设置中输入代码。','Prices'=>'价格','Show as'=>'显示为','Scrolling ticker'=>'滚动资讯条','Cards'=>'卡片','Price chart (one coin)'=>'价格图表（单币）','Period'=>'周期','24 hours'=>'24 小时','7 days'=>'7天','30 days'=>'30 天','90 days'=>'90 天','Currency'=>'货币','Coins'=>'硬币','Prices come from CoinGecko and are kept on your site for a few minutes, so visitors never wait for it.'=>'价格来自 CoinGecko 并在您的网站上保留数分钟，因此访客无需等待。','Crypto prices'=>'加密货币价格','Choose the coins in the sidebar.'=>'在边栏中选择硬币。','Cursor effect'=>'光标效果','A ring follows the pointer'=>'圆环跟随指针','A soft spotlight'=>'柔和聚光灯','A trail of dots'=>'点线轨迹','Where'=>'位置','Over this section'=>'此部分上方','Over the whole page'=>'覆盖整个页面','The real pointer always stays. The effect is off on touch screens and for visitors who ask their device for less motion.'=>'真实的指针始终保留。该效果在触摸屏上以及对在设备中请求减少动态效果的访客处于关闭状态。','Switch'=>'切换','Number'=>'数字','That has no rows under its first line. The first line is used for the column names.'=>'第一行下方没有数据行。第一行用于列名。','Import a CSV file'=>'导入 CSV 文件','Or paste CSV'=>'或粘贴 CSV','Comma, semicolon or tab separated. The first line holds the column names. Importing replaces the table.'=>'由逗号、分号或制表符分隔。第一行包含列名。导入将替换现有表格。','Import pasted CSV'=>'导入粘贴的 CSV','Says what the table shows. Screen readers announce it even when it is empty on screen.'=>'说明表格显示的内容。即使屏幕上显示为空，屏幕阅读器也会将其朗读出来。','Visitors can sort by a column'=>'访客可以按列排序','Show a search field'=>'显示搜索框','First column names each row'=>'第一列为每行