','Space-separated effect names carried over from older versions, for example: hover-shadow'=>'从旧版本沿用下来的以空格分隔的效果名称，例如：hover-shadow','Full width, content kept in the middle'=>'全宽，内容保持居中','Link relationship'=>'链接关系','Left'=>'左','Right'=>'右','Add text…'=>'添加文本…','Placement'=>'版位','On its own line'=>'单独一行','In the line, beside other content'=>'在行内，其他内容旁','Automatic (own line at the top level of the page)'=>'自动（页面顶层的独立行）','Accessible label'=>'无障碍标签','Leave empty for a decorative icon.'=>'对于装饰性图标，请留空。','Choose an icon in the block settings.'=>'在区块设置中选择一个图标。','New setting name'=>'新设置名称','For example: title or text'=>'例如：标题或文本','Add setting'=>'添加设置','Widget'=>'小工具','Choose a widget'=>'选择一个小部件','Widget area'=>'小工具区域','Choose a widget area'=>'选择微件区域','This image has no width and height, so the page will jump when it loads. Choose it from the Media Library, or set its width and height.'=>'此图像没有宽度和高度，因此页面在加载时会跳动。请从媒体库中选择它，或设置其宽度和高度。','This video is not from the Media Library, so its size is unknown and the page will jump when it loads. Upload it to the Media Library instead.'=>'此视频并非来自媒体库，因此其尺寸未知，页面在加载时会发生跳动。请改为将其上传至媒体库。','An image, video or frame in this HTML has no width and height, so the page will jump when it loads. Add width and height attributes to it.'=>'此 HTML 中的图像、视频或框架缺少宽度和高度，因此页面在加载时会发生跳动。请为其添加宽度和高度属性。','This embed resizes itself after it loads, which moves the content below it. Give it room or place it lower on the page.'=>'该嵌入内容加载后会自动调整大小，从而移动其下方的内部。请为其留出空间，或将其放置在页面较下方的位置。','Layout shift'=>'布局偏移','This widget does not describe its settings, so they are edited as name and value pairs.'=>'此小工具未描述其设置，因此它们将作为名称和值对进行编辑。','Problem'=>'问题','Check'=>'检查','Show block'=>'显示区块','Use a readable theme colour'=>'请使用易读的主题颜色','Make it H%d'=>'设为 H%d','Alt text'=>'替代文本','Save alt text'=>'保存替代文本','This image is decorative'=>'此图像仅用于装饰','Checking…'=>'正在检查…','No accessibility problems found on this page.'=>'在此页面上未发现无障碍问题。','%1$s, %2$s.'=>'%1$s, %2$s.','%d problem'=>'%d 个问题','%d thing to check'=>'%d 个待检查项','Check again'=>'重新检查','An automatic check finds many problems but not all of them. Also try the page with the keyboard alone and with a screen reader.'=>'自动检查能发现许多问题，但并非全部。请同时尝试仅使用键盘以及使用屏幕阅读器浏览该页面。','Text contrast is %1$s:1; it needs at least %2$s:1 to be readable.'=>'文本对比度为 %1$s:1；至少需要 %2$s:1 才能清晰可读。','click here,here,read more,more,link,this link,learn more,go'=>'点击这里,这里,阅读更多,更多,链接,此链接,了解更多,前往','A link has no text, so a screen reader announces only “link”. Add text or a label.'=>'链接没有文本，因此屏幕阅读器只会朗读“链接”。请添加文本或标签。','The link text “%s” does not say where it goes. Describe the destination instead.'=>'链接文本“%s”未说明其指向何处。请改为描述目标页面。','An element has a positive tabindex, which changes the keyboard order away from the reading order. Use 0 or remove it.'=>'某个元素具有正值的 tabindex，这会改变键盘导航顺序，使其脱离原本的阅读顺序。请使用 0 或将其移除。','Something clickable cannot be reached with the keyboard. Use a real button or link.'=>'无法使用键盘访问可点击的元素。请使用真实的按钮或链接。','An embedded frame has no title, so a screen reader cannot say what it is.'=>'嵌入的框架没有标题，因此屏幕阅读器无法播报其内容。','A form field has no label, so its purpose is not announced.'=>'表单字段缺少标签，因此无法读出其用途。','This heading is empty. Screen reader users navigate by headings; remove it or add text.'=>'此标题为空。屏幕阅读器用户通过标题进行导航；请将其移除或添加文本。','The page title is already the H1; use H2 for the top level of the content.'=>'页面标题已经是 H1；请对内容的最高级别使用 H2。','This H%1$d skips a level; the one before it is H%2$d. Make it an H%3$d.'=>'此 H%1$d 跳过了一个级别；其前一个标题为 H%2$d。请将其更改为 H%3$d。','This image has no alt text. Describe it, or mark it as decorative if it adds nothing.'=>'此图像没有替代文本。请对其进行描述，如果未添加任何实质内容，请将其标记为装饰性图像。','Close panel'=>'关闭面板','Desktop'=>'电脑','Default'=>'默认','Every track'=>'每个音轨','Track sizes, for example: 1fr 2fr 200px'=>'轨道大小，例如：1fr 2fr 200px','Custom track sizes'=>'自定义轨道大小','Equal tracks'=>'等宽轨道','One quoted row per line, for example: "head head" "side main". Name the area on each child block.'=>'每行一行用引号引起来的内容，例如："head head" "side main"。请为每个子区块上的区域命名。','Automatic'=>'