s'=>'所有类','Class name on the page'=>'页面上的类名','Printed as %s.'=>'已打印为 %s。','Start with a letter; lowercase letters, digits and hyphens only.'=>'请以字母开头；仅限小写字母、数字和连字符。','The style controls are not loaded. Reload the page; if this stays, reinstall the plugin.'=>'样式控件未加载。请重新加载页面；如果问题仍然存在，请重新安装插件。','Class saved. Every element using it has the new style.'=>'类已保存。使用它的每个元素都具有新样式。','Save class'=>'保存类','Class created.'=>'类已创建。','New class'=>'新类','e.g. Card'=>'例如：卡片','Create'=>'创建','Search classes'=>'搜索类','No class matches.'=>'无匹配的类。','No classes yet. Create one, style it, then add it to any element from its settings.'=>'尚无类。请创建一个类，为其设置样式，然后从其设置中将其添加到任意元素。','Edit %s'=>'编辑 %s','Class duplicated.'=>'类已复制。','Delete %s'=>'删除 %s','Class deleted.'=>'类已删除。','Delete the class "%s"? Elements that use it keep their content and lose its styles.'=>'删除类“%s”？使用它的元素将保留其内容并丢失其样式。','Only users who may add unfiltered HTML can change custom CSS.'=>'只有可以添加未过滤 HTML 的用户才能更改自定义 CSS。','Some of this CSS will not be used: @import, expression(), javascript: URLs, "<" and unbalanced braces are removed for safety.'=>'此 CSS 的一部分将不会被使用：出于安全考虑，@import、expression()、javascript: URL、“<”以及不匹配的大括号已被移除。','Upload a font'=>'上传字体','Uploading fonts needs WordPress 6.5 or later.'=>'上传字体需要 WordPress 6.5 或更高版本。','Font name'=>'字体名称','e.g. Brand Sans'=>'例：Brand Sans','%s is uploaded and ready to use.'=>'%s 已上传并可以使用。','Choose a font file (%s)'=>'选择字体文件 (%s)','Font library'=>'字体库','%d files'=>'%d 个文件','Font switched off for the site.'=>'已为此站点停用字体。','Font switched on for the site.'=>'已为站点启用字体。','Switch off'=>'关闭','Switch on'=>'开启','Adobe Fonts'=>'Adobe Fonts','Paste the kit id of your Adobe Fonts web project. Its fonts are then loaded from Adobe on your pages.'=>'粘贴您的 Adobe Fonts Web 项目的 Kit ID。随后即可从 Adobe 将其字体加载到您的页面上。','Your web projects'=>'您的 Web 项目','Adobe Fonts connected.'=>'Adobe Fonts 已连接。','Adobe Fonts disconnected.'=>'Adobe Fonts 已断开连接。','Kit id'=>'套件 ID','The dark value for "%s" is not a valid colour.'=>'“%s”的暗色值不是有效颜色。','When a visitor has not chosen'=>'当访问者尚未选择时','Follow the visitor’s device'=>'依访问者的设备而定','Dark colours'=>'暗色','Give each colour its dark version. Colours left empty stay the same in both schemes. Dark mode is on as soon as one colour has a dark value.'=>'为每种颜色指定其深色版本。留空的颜色在两种方案中保持不变。只要有一种颜色具有深色值，深色模式就会立即开启。','Dark version of %s'=>'%s 的深色版本','Dark mode saved.'=>'暗色模式已保存。','Page CSS'=>'页面 CSS','Global classes'=>'全局类','Classes'=>'类','Create classes in Site design, then add them here.'=>'在站点设计中创建类，然后将其添加到此处。','Custom CSS'=>'额外 CSS','Write rules for this element. "selector" means this element, e.g. selector:hover { opacity: .8 } — plain declarations apply to the element itself.'=>'为此元素编写规则。"selector" 代表此元素，例如 selector:hover { opacity: .8 } — 普通声明将应用于元素本身。','Font files must be %s.'=>'字体文件必须为 %s。','That font file is empty or larger than 10 MB.'=>'该字体文件为空或大于 10 MB。','Style once, reuse everywhere, change in one place.'=>'设定一次样式，处处复用，一处修改。','Variables'=>'变量','Named values any element can use.'=>'任何元素都可以使用的指定值。','Spacing, radius and shadows'=>'间距、圆角与阴影','The scales every spacing, corner and shadow picker offers.'=>'每个间距、圆角和阴影选择器所提供的比例。','A dark version of your colours, for visitors who want it.'=>'您的配色的深色版本，供有需要的访客使用。','Logo, colours, fonts and tone of voice, used by the AI and templates.'=>'徽标、颜色、字体和语气，由人工智能和模板使用。','Upload your own fonts or connect Adobe Fonts.'=>'上传您自己的字体或连接 Adobe Fonts。','CSS for this page only.'=>'仅适用于此页面的 CSS。','CSS for this page'=>'此页面的 CSS','Loaded only on this page, after the site’s styles. Saved with the page.'=>'仅在此页面加载，位于站点样式之后。随页面一起保存。','Short name'=>'简称','The short name "%s" is used twice.'=>'短名称“%s”被使用了两次。','"%s": short names use lowercase letters, digits and hyphens.'=>'“%s”：短名称使用小写字母、数字和连字符。','The value of "%s" is not one this setting accepts.'=>'“%s”的值不是此设置所接受的值。','Radius'=>'半径','Add a step'=>'添加步骤','Scales saved.'=>'比例已保存。','Scales are back to the defaults.'=>'比例已恢复为默认值。','Reset to the default scales'=>'重置为默认比例','No variables yet. A variable holds one value — a width, a colour mix, a font size — that many elements share.'=>'尚无变量。一个变量包含一个被多个元素共享的值，例如宽度、混色或字体大小。','Add variable'=>'添加变量','Variables saved.'=>'变量已保存。','Entrance animation'=>'入场动画','Fade in'=>'淡入','Fade in, rising'=>'淡入，上升','Fade in, dropping'=>'淡入，下落','Fade in from the start side'=>'从起始边渐显','Fade in from the end side'=>'从末端淡入','Zoom out'=>'缩小','Flip up'=>'向上翻转','Animation length (ms)'=>'动画时长（毫秒）','Animation delay (ms)'=>'动画延迟 (毫秒)','While scrolling'=>'滚动时','Fade in as it scrolls into view'=>'滚动到视图时淡入','Rise as it scrolls into view'=>'滚动到视图时上升','Grow as it scrolls into view'=>'滚动到视图时放大','Straighten as it scrolls into view'=>'滚动到视图中时拉直','On hover'=>'悬停时','Lift'=>'解除','Glow'=>'发光','Stay in view (px from the top)'=>'停留在视图中（距顶部 px）','Parallax speed (-10 to 10)'=>'视差速度（-10 到 10）','Follow the pointer (strength)'=>'沿指示方向操作（强度）','Place ID'=>'地点 ID','Find it with Google’s Place ID finder: search for your business and copy the ID.'=>'使用 Google 的 Place ID 查找器找到它：搜索您的商家并复制该 ID。','An API key from your Google Cloud project with the Places API (New) enabled. Restrict it to that API.'=>'来自您的 Google Cloud 项目且已启用 Places API (New) 的 API 密钥。请将其限制为该 API。','Business unit ID'=>'业务部门 ID','The 24-character ID of your business on Trustpilot, from your Trustpilot Business account (Integrations › API).'=>'您在 Trustpilot 上的 24 位字符商户 ID，获取自您的 Trustpilot Business 账户（Integrations › API）。','The API key of your Trustpilot Business account.'=>'您的 Trustpilot Business 帳戶的 API 金鑰。','Not set up.'=>'未设置。','The saved key can no longer be read (the site’s security keys changed). Enter it again.'=>'无法再读取已保存的密钥（站点的安全密钥已更改）。请重新输入。','Needs both an ID and an API key.'=>'需要 ID 和 API 密钥。','Set up. Google reviews are loaded live each time a page with a Reviews block is viewed: one Place Details request on your own key per view, never stored (Google’s terms do not allow keeping them).'=>'设置。每次查看包含评价区块的页面时，都会实时加载 Google 评价：每次查看都会使用您自己的密钥发起一次 Place Details 请求，绝不会被存储（Google 的条款不允许保留这些内容）。','The first refresh failed: %s'=>'首次刷新失败：%s','Waiting for the first refresh (within a minute or two).'=>'正在等待首次刷新（一至两分钟内）。','Refreshed %1$s: %2$d reviews kept, rated %3$s from %4$d.'=>'已刷新 %1$s：保留了 %2$d 条评价，评分为 %3$s（满分 %4$d）。','The last try, %1$s, failed and the reviews above were kept: %2$s'=>'最后一次尝试 %1$s 失败，上述评论已保留：%2$s','Saved. Trustpilot reviews are fetched in the background within a minute or two; Google reviews load live on the page.'=>'已保存。Trustpilot 评价会在一两分钟内在后台提取；Google 评价会直接在页面上实时加载。','Trustpilot reviews are fetched once a day in the background and kept on your site, so a busy page costs nothing extra on your Trustpilot account; if a refresh fails, the last reviews stay. Google does not allow its reviews to be stored, so they are loaded live when a visitor views the page: each view is one request on your own Google key, billed by Google.'=>'Trustpilot 评价每天在后台获取一次并保存在您的网站上，因此访问繁忙的页面不会在您的 Trustpilot 账户中产生额外费用；如果刷新失败，将保留最新获取的评价。Google 不允许存储其评价，因此在访客查看页面时会即时加载：每次查看都是针对您自己的 Google 密钥发起的一次请求，由 Google 计费。','Where to find it'=>'在何处找到','Saved (…%s). Type a new one to replace it.'=>'已保存（…%s）。请输入新内容以进行替换。','Remove the %s details and its reviews'=>'移除 %s 详细信息及其评价','Refreshed.'=>'已刷新。','Refresh now'=>'立即刷新','Next daily refresh: %s.'=>'下次每日刷新：%s。','Your Google and Trustpilot details, for the Reviews block.'=>'用于评价区块的 Google 和 Trustpilot 详细信息。','No colours yet.'=>'尚无颜色。','Colour %d'=>'颜色 %d','Add colour'=>'添加颜色','Two colours have the same name. Rename one.'=>'两种颜色具有相同的名称。请重命名其中一种。','"%s" is not a valid colour.'=>'“%s”不是有效的颜色。','Theme colours'=>'主题颜色','Your theme’s palette. A change here is saved as your site’s version of the colour, the same way the Site Editor saves it, and applies everywhere the colour is used.'=>'您主题的调色板。此处的更改将保存为您网站的颜色版本，就像“网站编辑器”保存该颜色一样，并应用于使用该颜色的所有位置。','Theme colours are back to the theme’s own values.'=>'主题颜色已恢复为主题原本的数值。','Reset theme colours'=>'重置主题颜色','Your colours'=>'您的颜色','Colours saved.'=>'颜色已保存。','Pick a colour for %s'=>'为%s挑选颜色','Clear'=>'清除','The change could not be saved.'=>'无法保存更改。','Theme default'=>'主题默认','Theme fonts'=>'主题字体','Your fonts'=>'您的字体','Font stack'=>'字体栈','Uploaded font: its files come from the font library.'=>'已上传的字体：其文件来自字体库。','System sans-serif'=>'系统无衬线字体','Add font stack'=>'添加字体系列','Fonts saved.'=>'字体已保存。','Shared with your theme and the Site Editor.'=>'已与您的主题和站点编辑器共享。','Fonts'=>'字体','Heading and body fonts for the whole site.'=>'整个站点的标题和正文字体。','Back to Site design'=>'返回站点设计','Classes, tokens, dark mode, brand kit and custom fonts come with Pro'=>'类、令牌、深色模式、品牌工具包和自定义字体随 Pro 提供','Open the Site Editor’s styles'=>'打开站点编辑器样式','A heading with a tighter line height, styled with the Style tab.'=>'行高更紧凑的标题，通过“样式”选项卡进行设置。','A paragraph of text, styled with the Style tab.'=>'一段文本，已通过“Style”标签页设置样式。','An image with rounded corners, styled with the Style tab.'=>'带有圆角的图像，已使用“样式”选项卡设置样式。','A video from the Media Library, styled with the Style tab.'=>'来自媒体库的视频，已使用“样式”选项卡设置样式。','Spacer'=>'间距底块','Empty space between blocks; set a different height per screen size in the Style tab.'=>'区块之间的空白区域；请在“样式”标签页中为不同的屏幕尺寸设置不同高度。','Divider'=>'分隔线','A horizontal line between sections, styled with the Style tab.'=>'各节之间的水平线，可通过“样式”（Style）选项卡设置样式。','Content from another site (a video, a post, a map) by pasting its address.'=>'通过粘贴其地址来嵌入来自其他网站的内容（视频、文章、地图）。','Several images in a grid, styled with the Style tab.'=>'网格中的多张图像，已使用“样式”选项卡设置样式。','Plain'=>'纯文本','No languages to switch between. The switcher appears when a translation plugin lists two or more languages.'=>'没有可切换的语言。当翻译插件列出两种或更多语言时，切换器才会显示。','Switcher'=>'切换器','Show the current language'=>'显示当前语言','Install Tranzly and list two or more languages, and the switcher appears here.'=>'安装 Tranzly 并列出两种或更多语言，切换器就会显示在此处。','Pills'=>'胶囊标签','Dropdown'=>'下拉菜单','Language codes'=>'语言代码','Show each language as'=>'将每种语言显示为','Language name'=>'语言名称','Language code'=>'语言代码','Name and code'=>'名称和代码','Flags'=>'标记','Off by default: a flag is a country, not a language.'=>'默认关闭：国旗代表的是国家，而不是语言。','Include the current language'=>'包含当前语言','Hide languages this page is not translated into'=>'隐藏未翻译此页面的语言','Stack vertically'=>'垂直堆叠','Current language text'=>'当前语言文本','Current language background'=>'当前语言背景','Size and spacing'=>'尺寸与间距','Space between languages'=>'语言间距','Text size'=>'文字大小','%1$d converted, %2$d approximated, %3$d not converted.'=>'%1$d 个已转换，%2$d 个近似，%3$d 个未转换。','Edit the new draft'=>'编辑新草稿','Not converted'=>'未转换','Converted, but not exactly'=>'已转换，但并非完全一致','Converted %1$d of %2$d.'=>'已转换 %2$d 个中的 %1$d 个。','Looking for pages…'=>'正在查找页面…','No pages built with Elementor, Divi, Beaver Builder or WPBakery were found on this site.'=>'在此站点上未找到使用 Elementor、Divi、Beaver Builder 或 WPBakery 构建的页面。','%d page was built with another builder. Converting makes a new draft made of blocks; the original page is not changed.'=>'%d 个页面是使用另一个构建器制作的。转换会创建一个由区块组成的新草稿；原始页面不会被更改。','Convert every page in this list'=>'转换此列表中的每个页面','Built with'=>'构建于','Converted before: edit the draft'=>'之前已转换：编辑草稿','Convert again'=>'重新转换','Convert'=>'转换','Exported from'=>'导出自','Export file'=>'导出文件','Or paste the export'=>'或粘贴导出内容','Elementor: a template exported as .json. Divi: a layout exported from the Divi Library, or the page’s shortcodes or blocks. WPBakery: the page’s shortcodes (Classic mode). Beaver Builder: the page’s saved data.'=>'Elementor：导出为 .json 的模板。Divi：从 Divi Library 导出的布局，或者页面的简码或区块。WPBakery：页面的简码（经典模式）。Beaver Builder：页面保存的数据。','Title of the new page'=>'新页面的标题','Copy images from the other site into this site’s media library'=>'将另一网站的图像复制到此网站的媒体库','Convert into a new page'=>'转换为新页面','Turn a Figma frame into an editable page: auto layout becomes rows, columns and grids, text keeps its fonts and sizes, and images are copied into your media library. The site talks to Figma with your own Figma account; nothing goes through us.'=>'将 Figma 画框转换为可编辑页面：auto layout 会变为行、列和网格，文本保留其字体和字号，图像会被复制到您的媒体库中。该网站通过您自己的 Figma 账户与 Figma 进行通信；任何内容都不会经过我们。','Figma personal access token'=>'Figma 个人访问令牌','In Figma: Settings, Security, Personal access tokens, Generate new token, with the “File content: read” scope. It is stored encrypted and never shown again.'=>'在 Figma 中：设置、安全性、个人访问令牌、生成新令牌，并包含“File content: read”作用域。它已被加密存储，且不会再次显示。','How to create a Figma token'=>'如何创建 Figma 令牌','Connect Figma'=>'连接 Figma','Figma frame link'=>'Figma 画框链接','In Figma, select one frame, then right-click: Copy/Paste as, Copy link to selection.'=>'在 Figma 中，选择一个画框，然后右键单击：Copy/Paste as、Copy link to selection。','Title of the new page (optional)'=>'新页面的标题（可选）','Import the frame'=>'导入框架','Import from other builders and Figma'=>'从其他构建器和 Figma 导入','Pages built with Elementor, Divi, Beaver Builder or WPBakery'=>'使用 Elementor、Divi、Beaver Builder 或 WPBakery 构建的页面','Import an export file'=>'导入导出文件','Import from Figma'=>'从 Figma 导入','Connected (key %s).'=>'已连接（密钥 %s）。','API URL'=>'API URL','Replace the API key'=>'替换 API 密钥','Where to find your %s API key'=>'何处查找您的 %s API 密钥','Check and save'=>'检查并保存','Connect a mailing-list service once; then any form can add the people who fill it in to one of your lists (the form block\'s settings → After sending). Keys are checked with the service, stored encrypted on this site and never shown again.'=>'只需连接一次邮件列表服务；之后任何表单都可以将填写该表单的用户添加到您的某个列表中（表单区块设置 → 发送后）。密钥已由该服务验证，加密存储在此网站上，且绝不会再次显示。','Send form submissions and button clicks to your analytics with no code. Leave an ID empty to skip that service. Buttons get a "Conversion event" field in their Advanced panel. With the cookie banner on, nothing loads until the visitor agrees.'=>'无需代码即可将表单提交和按钮点击发送到您的分析中。将 ID 留空可跳过该服务。按钮在其“高级”面板中会获得一个“转化事件”字段。在 Cookie 横幅开启的情况下，在访问者同意之前不会加载任何内容。','Google Analytics 4 measurement ID'=>'Google Analytics 4 衡量 ID','Google Tag Manager container ID'=>'Google Tag Manager 容器 ID','Meta Pixel ID (the number shown in Meta Events Manager)'=>'Meta Pixel ID（Meta 事件管理工具中显示的编号）','Load these tags on my site'=>'在我的站点上加载这些标签','Switch off if your theme or another plugin already adds them; events are still sent.'=>'如果您的主题或其他插件已添加它们，请将其关闭；事件仍会发送。','Event name for form submissions'=>'表单提交的事件名称','The banner is a popup you design with blocks. Its buttons link to #consent-accept, #consent-reject and #consent-save (with tick boxes named analytics and marketing for "save"); a link to #consent-open anywhere shows it again. Until a visitor accepts, tracking tags do not load, Google Consent Mode stays "denied", and the scripts you list stay switched off.'=>'横幅是您使用区块设计的弹出窗口。其按钮链接至 #consent-accept、#consent-reject 和 #consent-save（针对“save”提供名为 analytics 和 marketing 的复选框）；任何位置指向 #consent-open 的链接都会再次显示该横幅。在访客接受之前，跟踪代码不会加载，Google Consent Mode 保持为“denied”，并且您列出的脚本保持关闭状态。','Create a ready-made banner'=>'创建现成横幅','Show a cookie banner'=>'显示 Cookie 横幅','Banner'=>'横幅','Choose a popup…'=>'选择一个弹出窗口…','%s (draft)'=>'%s (草稿)','Edit the banner'=>'编辑横幅','Remember the choice for (days)'=>'记住选择 (天)','Outside the European Union, the EEA and the UK: load tracking until the visitor says no'=>'欧盟、欧洲经济区和英国境外：加载跟踪，直至访问者拒绝','Off: every visitor must agree first (the strictest rule, and the default). On: only when your host or CDN reports the visitor\'s country (for example Cloudflare\'s CF-IPCountry header) and it is outside the EU, EEA, UK and Switzerland. The banner is still shown, and an unknown country is treated as inside the EU.'=>'关闭：每位访客必须首先同意（最严格的规则，也是默认设置）。开启：仅当您的主机或 CDN 报告访客的国家/地区（例如 Cloudflare 的 CF-IPCountry 标头）且该国家/地区位于 EU、EEA、英国和瑞士境外时。横幅仍会显示，未知国家/地区将被视为位于 EU 境内。','Other scripts to hold until consent (handle:analytics or handle:marketing, comma separated)'=>'在获得同意前保留的其他脚本（handle:analytics 或 handle:marketing，以逗号分隔）','Popups, slide-ins and bars'=>'弹窗、浮窗和横幅栏','A/B test results'=>'A/B 测试结果','Guides: forms, popups, motion, tracking, A/B tests and the cookie banner'=>'指南：表单、弹出窗口、动态效果、跟踪、A/B 测试和 Cookie 横幅','Mailing-list connections'=>'邮件列表连接','Popup settings'=>'弹窗设置','Popup (in the middle, page dimmed)'=>'弹窗（居中，页面变暗）','Slide-in (in a corner)'=>'滑入（角落）','Bar (top or bottom)'=>'栏（顶